    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000941",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 941",
      "hadith_number": "941",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه قال: سمعت رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم يقول: “إذا صليتم علي الميت، فأخلصوا له الدعاء\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’nin (ra) işttiğine göre Resûlullah : Cenaze namazı kıldığınız zaman, ölü için bütün samimiyetinizle dua edin, buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying: \"When you pray over the dead, make a sincere supplication for him.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/941:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/941:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/941:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
