        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001715",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1715",
      "hadith_number": "1715",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"من حلف فقال: إني بريء من الإسلام، فإن كان كاذبًا، فهو كما قال، وإن كان صادقًا، فلن يرجع إلى الإسلام سالمًا\".",
      "text_tr": "Abdullah b. Semüre’den (ra) nakledildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Ne putlar adına, ne de babalarınız adına yemin edin.",
      "text_en": "Buraidah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"If anyone swears that in such and such case he will be free from Islam and afterwards he turns out to be a liar, he will be as he has sworn; but if he is speaking the truth, he will not revert safely to Islam.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1715:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1715:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1715:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000121",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 121",
      "hadith_number": "121",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "-الخامس: عنه قال لي النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم: \" لا تحقرن من المعروف شيئاً ولو أن تلقى أخاك بوجهٍ طليق\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Zer (ra) rivayet ediyor: Peygamber bana şöyle dedi: Hiçbir iyiliği küçümseme; isterse bu, kardeşini güler yüzle karşılamak olsun.",
      "text_en": "Abu Dharr (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"Do not belittle any good deed, even meeting your brother (Muslim) with a cheerful face\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/121:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/121:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/121:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000071",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 71",
      "hadith_number": "71",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "الثالث: عن ابن مسعود رضي الله عنه أن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم كان يقول: \"اللهم إني أسألك الهدى والتقى والعفاف والغنى\"",
      "text_tr": "İbn Mes’ûd’dan (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Peygamber şöyle derdi: Allah’ım, senden hidayet, takva, iffet ve gönül zenginliği isterim.",
      "text_en": "'Abdullah bin Mas'ud (May Allah be pleased with him) reported that the Prophet (ﷺ) used to say: \"Allahumma inni as'alukal-huda wat- tuqa wal-'afafa wal-ghina (O Allah! I ask You for guidance, piety, chastity and self- sufficiency)\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/71:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/71:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/71:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000793",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 793",
      "hadith_number": "793",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "عن أسماء بنت يزيد الأنصارية رضى الله عنها قالت: كان كم قميص رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم إلى الرسغ.",
      "text_tr": "Esmâ bint Yezîd el-Ensâriyye’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre o, şöyle demiştir: Resûlullah’ın gömleğinin kolu bileğine kadar uzanırdı.",
      "text_en": "Asma' bint Yazid (May Allah be pleased with her) reported: The sleeves of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ)'s Qamees reached down to his wrists.",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/793:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/793:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/793:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001805",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1805",
      "hadith_number": "1805",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "عن عليّ رضي الله عنه قال: حفظت عن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"لا يتم بعد احتلام، ولا صمات يوم إلى الليل\". قال الخطابي في تفسير هذا الحديث: كان من نسك الجاهلية الصمات، فنهوا في الإسلام عن ذلك، وأمروا بالذكر والحديث بالخير.",
      "text_tr": "Enes’ten (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Hz. Peygamber , bir erkeğin (teninde veya giysisinde) zağferan (safran) kullanmasını yasaklamıştır.",
      "text_en": "'Ali (May Allah be pleased with him) said: I have retained in my memory the saying of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) that: \"No one is considered an orphan after he has attained the age of maturity; and it is unlawful to remain silent from dawn till night.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1805:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1805:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1805:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001764",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1764",
      "hadith_number": "1764",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "عن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"إذا أقيمت الصلاة، فلا صلاة إلا المكتوبة\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Mersed Kennâz b. Husayn’ın (ra) işittiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Kabre karşı namaz kılmayın, kabir üzerine de oturmayın.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"When the Iqamah is called, no prayer should be performed except the obligatory prayer.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1764:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1764:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1764:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001581",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1581",
      "hadith_number": "1581",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن جُندب بن عبد الله رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"قال رجل: والله لا يغفر الله لفلان، فقال الله عز وجل: من ذا الذي يتألى علي أن لا أغفر لفلان! فإني قد غفرت له، وأحبطت عملك\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Müslüman kardeşini küçük görmesi, kişiye kötülük olarak yeter.",
      "text_en": "Jundub bin 'Abdullah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Once someone said: 'By Allah! Allah will not forgive such and such (a person).' Thereupon Allah, the Exalted and the Glorious, said: 'Who is he who takes an oath in My Name that I will not grant pardon to so-and-so? I have granted pardon to so-and-so and rendered your good deeds fruitless.\"'.",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1581:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1581:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1581:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001689",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1689",
      "hadith_number": "1689",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي طلحة رضي الله عنه أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"لا تدخل الملائكة بيتًا فيه كلب ولا صورة\"",
      "text_tr": "İbn Mes’ûd’un (ra) işittiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Kıyamet günü en çetin azaba uğrayacak olanlar, resim/heykel yapanlardır.",
      "text_en": "Abu Talhah (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"The angels do not enter a house in which there is a dog or a portrait.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1689:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1689:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1689:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000340",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 340",
      "hadith_number": "340",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي عيسى المغيرة بن شعبة رضي الله عنه عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"إن الله تعالى حرم عليكم عقوق الأمهات، ومنعًا وهات، ووأد البنات، وكره لكم قيل وقال، وكثرة السؤال ، وإضاعة المال\"",
      "text_tr": "İbn Ömer’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Hz. Peygamber şöyle buyurmuştur: En güzel iyilik, bir kimsenin, baba dostunu görüp gözetmesidir.",
      "text_en": "Abu 'Isa Al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"Allah has forbidden you: disobedience to your mothers, to withhold (what you should give), or demand (what you do not deserve), and to bury your daughters alive. And Allah dislikes idle talk, to ask too many questions (for things which will be of no benefit to one), and to waste your wealth\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/340:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/340:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/340:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000439",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 439",
      "hadith_number": "439",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي موسى الأشعري، رضي الله عنه ، عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \" إذا أراد الله تعالى، رحمة أمةٍ ، قبض نبيها قبلها، فجعله لها فرطاً وسلفاً بين يديها، وإذا أراد هلكة أمةٍ، عذبها ونبيها حي، فأهلكها وهو حى ينظر، فأقر عينه بهلاكها حين كذبوه وعصوا امره\"",
      "text_tr": "Yine Enes’ten (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Allah, yeyip içtikten sonra kendisine hamd eden kulundan razı olur.",
      "text_en": "Abu Mu sa Al-Ash'ari (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"When Allah intends to show mercy to a people, He collects their Prophet before them and makes him a herald to happiness for them in the Hereafter; and when He intends to destroy a people, He punishes them while their Prophet is alive, and destroys them while he is alive and watches them and makes him witness their destruction because they disbelieved in him and disobeyed his commands\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/439:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/439:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/439:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000667",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 667",
      "hadith_number": "667",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عبد الله بن عمرو رضي الله عنهما قال: كنا مع رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم في سفر، فنزلنا منزلاً، فمنا من يصلح خباءه، ومنا من ينتضل، ومنا من هو في جشره، إذ نادى منادي رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم الصلاة جامعة. فاجتمعنا إلى رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم فقال: “إنه لم يكن نبي قبلي إلا كان حقاً عليه أن يدل أمته على خير ما يعلمه لهم، وينذرهم شر ما يعلمه لهم، وإن أمتكم هذه جعل عاقبتها في أولها، وسيصيب آخرها بلاء وأمور تنكرونها، وتجئ فتن يرقق بعضها بعضاً، وتجئ الفتنة فيقول المؤمن : هذه مهلكتي، ثم تنكشف؛ وتجئ الفتنة فيقول المؤمن: هذه هذه، فمن أحب أن يزحزح عن النار، ويدخل الجنة، فلتأته منيته وهو يؤمن بالله واليوم الأخر، وليأت إلى الناس الذى يحب أن يؤتى إليه. ومن بايع إماماً فأعطاه صفقة يده، وثمرة قلبه، فليطعه إن استطاع، فإن جاء آخر ينازعه، فاضربوا عنق الآخر” . قوله: “ينتضل” أى : يسابق بالرمي بالنبل والنشاب. “والجشر” بفتح الجيم والشين المعجمة وبالراء: وهى الدواب التى ترعى وتبيت مكانها. وقوله: “يرقق بعضها بعضاً” أى: يصير بعضها بعضا رقيقاً، أى :خفيفاً لعظم ما بعده، فالثانى يرقق الأول. وقيل: معناه، يشوق بعضها إلى بعض بتحسينها وتسويليها، وقيل: يشبه بعضها بعضاً.",
      "text_tr": "İbn Ömer (ra) şöyle demiştir: Biz “dinlemek ve itaat etmek üzere” biat ettiğimizde, Resûlullah , “gücünüz yettiği kadar” kaydını ilave ederdi.",
      "text_en": "'Abdullah bin 'Amr (May Allah be pleased with them) reported: We accompanied Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) on a journey. We halted at a place to take a rest. Some of us began to set right their tents, others began to graze their animals while others were engaged in competing with one another in archery when an announcer of Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) announced that people should gather for Salat. We gathered around the Messenger of Allah and he ((ﷺ)) addressed us, saying, \"Every Prophet before me was under obligation to guide his followers to what he knew was good for them and to warn the evil thing which he knew. As for this Ummah, it will have sound state and in its early stage of existence; but the last phase of its existence, will be faced with trials and with things you do not recognize. There will be tremendous trials, one after the other, and to each the believer will say, 'That is it'. Whenever a trial arrives the believer will say: 'This is going to bring about my destruction.' When this passes, another calamity will approach and he will say: 'This surely is going to be my end.' Whosoever wishes to be removed from the Fire (Hell) and admitted to Jannah should die with faith in Allah and the Last Day; and he should treat others as he wishes to be treated. He who swears allegiance to an Imam, he should give him the pledge in ratification and the sincerity of his heart. He should obey him to the best of his capacity. If another man comes forward as a claimant (when one has already been installed), behead the second.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/667:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/667:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/667:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001339",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1339",
      "hadith_number": "1339",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنه أنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"من عُلم الرمي ثم تركه فليس منا أو فقد عصى\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hammâd’dan rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle demiştir: Ok atmayı öğrenip de sonra terk eden bizden değildir yahut isyan etmiş olur.",
      "text_en": "'Uqbah bin 'Amir Al-Juhani (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"He who learnt archery and then neglected it, is not from us.\" (Or said,) \"He has been guilty of disobedience (to Messenger of Allah).\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1339:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1339:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1339:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001206",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1206",
      "hadith_number": "1206",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عائشة رضي الله عنها ان النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم : قال: \"السواك مطهرة للفم مرضاة للرب\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Mûsâ el-Eş’arî’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre o, şöyle demiştir: Bir gün Peygamber’in yanına girdim. Misvakının ucu dilinin üzerindeydi.",
      "text_en": "'Aishah (May Allah be pleased with her) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"The Miswak (tooth-stick) cleanses and purifies the mouth and pleases the Rubb.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1206:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1206:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1206:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001525",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1525",
      "hadith_number": "1525",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عقبة بن عامر رضي الله عنه قال: قلت يا رسول الله ما النجاة؟ قال: \"أمسك عليك لسانك، وليسعك بيتك، وابكِ على خطيئتك\"",
      "text_tr": "Ukbe b. Âmir (ra) anlatıyor: –Ey Allah’ın Resûlü, kurtuluş (yolu) nedir, diye sordum: –Dilini tut, evin ile yetin ve günahlarına ağla, buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "'Uqbah bin 'Amir (May Allah be pleased with him) said: I asked the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ), \"How can salvation be achieved?\" He replied, \"Control your tongue, keep to your house, and weep over your sins.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1525:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1525:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1525:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001727",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1727",
      "hadith_number": "1727",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "عن جابر رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"لا يسأل بوجه الله إلا الجنة\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’nin (ra) işittiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: (Alışverişte) yemin, malın satışını artırır, kazancın bereketini ise götürür.",
      "text_en": "Jabir (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"No one should ask in the Face of Allah for anything except Jannah.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1727:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1727:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1727:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000192",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 192",
      "hadith_number": "192",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "التاسع: عن أبي سعيد الحسن البصري أن عائذ بن عمرو رضي الله عنه دخل على عبيد الله بن زياد فقال: أي بني، إني سمعت رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم يقول: \"إن شر الرعاء الحطمة” فإياك أن تكون منهم. فقال له : اجلس فإنما أنت من نخالة أصحاب محمد صلى الله عليه وسلم ، فقال: وهل كانت لهم نخالة، إنما كانت النخالة بعدهم وفي غيرهم !",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Saîd el-Hudrî’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Peygamber şöyle demiştir: Cihadın en üstünü, zalim yöneticiye karşı adaleti dile getirmektir.",
      "text_en": "Abu Sa'id Al-Hasan Basri reported: 'Aidh bin 'Amr (the Companion) (May Allah be pleased with him) visited 'Ubaidullah bin Ziyad (the ruler) and said to him: \"Son, I heard Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying, 'The worst shepherds (rulers) are those who deal harshly in respect of supervision. Beware, Don't be one of them!\"' Ibn Ziyad said to him, \"Sit down, you are but husk from among the Companions of the Prophet (ﷺ).\" 'Aidh bin 'Amr (May Allah be pleased with him) retorted: \"Was there any husk among them? Surely, husk came after them and among others than them\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/192:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/192:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/192:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001042",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1042",
      "hadith_number": "1042",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي سعيد الخدري رضي الله عنه أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"إذا سمعتم النداء، فقولوا كما يقول المؤذن\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Saîd el-Hudrî’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah : Ezanı duyduğunuz zaman müezzinin söylediklerini siz de tekrar edin, buyurmuştur.",
      "text_en": "Abu Sa'id Al-Khudri (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"When you hear the Mu'adhdhin (pronouncing the call to Salat), repeat after him what he says.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1042:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1042:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1042:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000483",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 483",
      "hadith_number": "483",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عبد الله بن مغفل، رضي الله عنه، قال: قال رجل للنبي صلى الله عليه وسلم يارسول الله، والله إنى لأحبك، فقال: \" انظر ماذ تقول؟\" قال: والله إنى لأحبك، ثلاث مرات، فقال: \" إن كنت تحبنى فأعد للفقر تجفافاً، فإن الفقر أسرع إلى من يحبنى من السيل إلى منتهاه\" 'التجفاف بكسر التاء المثناه فوق وإسكان الجيم وبالفاء المكررة، وهو شىء يلبسة الفرس، ليتقي به الأذى، وقد يلبسة الإنسان.'",
      "text_tr": "Ka’b b. İyâz’ın (ra) Resûlullah’tan şöyle işittiği nakledilmiştir: Her ümmetin bir imtihan vesilesi vardır. Ümmetimin imtihan vesilesi de maldır.",
      "text_en": "'Abdullah bin Mughaffal (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: A man came to the Prophet (ﷺ) and said, \"O Messenger of Allah! By Allah, I love you.\" He (ﷺ) said, \"Think about what you are saying.\" The man repeated thrice, \"I swear by Allah that I love you.\" He (Prophet (ﷺ)) said, \"If you love me, you should be ready for acute poverty; because poverty comes to those who love me, faster than a flood flowing towards its destination.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/483:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/483:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/483:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000112",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 112",
      "hadith_number": "112",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وأما الأحاديث فالأول: عن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه، عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \" أعذر الله إلى امرئ أخر أجله حتى بلغ ستين سنة\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Peygamber şöyle demiştir: Allah Teâlâ, ölümünü atmış sene ertelediği kimse için mazeret bırakmamıştır.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"Allah excuses and grants forgiveness to a person until he attains the age of sixty years\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/112:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/112:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/112:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001473",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1473",
      "hadith_number": "1473",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن مسعود، رضي الله عنه، أن النبي، صلى الله عليه وسلم، كان يقول: \"اللهم إني أسألك الهدى، والتقى، والعفاف، والغنى\"",
      "text_tr": "İbn Mes’ûd’dan (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Peygamber şöyle dua ederdi: Allah’ım, senden hidayet, takva, iffet (onur) ve (gönül) zenginliği isterim.",
      "text_en": "'Abdullah bin Mas'ud (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) used to supplicate: \"Allahumma inni as'alukal-huda, wat-tuqa, wal-'afafa, wal-ghina (O Allah! I beseech You for guidance, piety, chastity and contentment).\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1473:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1473:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1473:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
