      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001367",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1367",
      "hadith_number": "1367",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "عن ابن عمر رضي الله عنهما أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"إن العبد إذا نصح لسيده، وأحسن عبادة الله، فله أجره مرتين\"",
      "text_tr": "İbn Ömer’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah : Efendisine karşı samimi olan ve Allah’a güzelce ibadet eden köleye iki kat ecir vardır, buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "Ibn 'Umar (May Allah be pleased with them) reported: I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying, \"When a slave is sincere to his master and worships Allah well, He will have a double reward.\" .",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1367:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1367:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1367:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
