    {
      "id": "hadith_001841",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1841",
      "hadith_number": "1841",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنه عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \" بين النفختين أربعون\" قالوا: يا أبا هريرة أربعون يوماً؟ قال: أبيت، قالوا: أربعون سنة؟ قال: أبيت، قالوا: أربعون شهراً؟ قال: أبيت\" ويبلى كل شئ من الإنسان إلا عجب ذنبه، فيه يركب الخلق، ثم ينزل الله من السماء ماء، فينبتون كما ينبت البقل\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den rivayet edildiğine göre Hz. Peygamber şöyle buyurmuştur: Mümin, aynı delikten iki defa sokulmaz (yani aynı konuda iki kere aldatılmaz).",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"Between the two Blowing of the Trumpet there will be an interval of forty.\" The people said, \"O Abu Hurairah! Do you mean forty days?\" He said, \"I cannot say anything.\" They said, \"Do you mean forty years?\" He said, \"I cannot say anything.\" They said, \"Do you mean forty months?\" He said, \"I cannot say anything. The Prophet added: 'Everything of the human body will perish except the last coccyx bone (end part of the spinal cord), and from that bone Allah will reconstruct the whole body. Then Allah will send down water from the sky and people will grow like green vegetables'.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1841:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1841:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1841:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001691",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1691",
      "hadith_number": "1691",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عائشة رضي الله عنها قالت: واعد رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم جبريل عليه السلام في ساعة أن يأتيه، فجاءت تلك الساعة ولم يأته! قالت: وكان بيده عصًا، فطرحها من يده وهو يقول: \"ما يخلف الله وعده ولا رسله\" ثم التفت، فإذا جرو كلب تحت سريره. فقال: \"متى دخل هذا الكلب؟\" فقلت: والله ما دريت به، فأمر به فأخرج، فجاءه جبريل عليه السلام: فقال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"وعدتني، فجلست لك ولم تأتني\" فقال: منعني الكلب الذي كان في بيتك، إنا لا ندخل بيتًا فيه كلب ولا صورة\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Talhâ’dan (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: İçinde köpek ve canlı resmi/heykeli bulunan bir eve (rahmet) melekler(i) girmez.",
      "text_en": "'Aishah (May Allah be pleased with her) said: Jibril (Gabriel) (ﷺ) made a promise with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) to come at a definite hour; that hour came but he did not visit him. There was a staff in the hand of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ). He threw it from his hand and said, \"Never does Allah back out of His Promise, nor do His messengers.\" Then he noticed a puppy under his bed and said, \"O 'Aishah, when did this dog enter?\" She said: \"By Allah, I don't know.\" He then commanded that it should be turned out. No sooner than had they expelled it, Jibril came and the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said to him, \"You promised to visit me. I waited for you but you did not come.\" Whereupon he said: \"The dog kept me from coming. We do not enter a house in which there is a dog or a picture.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1691:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1691:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1691:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001482",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1482",
      "hadith_number": "1482",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عائشة، رضي الله عنها، أن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم، كان يقول في دعائه: \"اللهم إني أعوذ بك من شر ما عملت ومن شر ما لم أعمل\"",
      "text_tr": "Âişe’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Peygamber şöyle dua ederdi: Allah’ım, şimdiye kadar yaptıklarımın ve henüz yapmadıklarımın şerrinden sana sığınırım.",
      "text_en": "'Aishah (May Allah be pleased with her) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) used to supplicate (in these words): \"Allahumma inni audhu bika min sharri ma 'amiltu, wa min sharri ma lam a'mal (O Allah! I seek refuge in You from the evil of that which I have done and the evil of that which I have not done).\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1482:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1482:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1482:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001308",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1308",
      "hadith_number": "1308",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي عبس عبد الرحمن بن جبير، رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: \"ما اغبرت قدما عبد في سبيل الله فتمسه النار\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Abs Abdurrahman b. Cübeyr’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle demiştir: Allah yolunda ayakları tozlanan kimseye cehennem ateşi dokunmaz.",
      "text_en": "Abu 'Abs 'Abdur-Rahman bin Jabr (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"It will not happen that the feet soiled with dust while (doing Jihad) in the way of Allah, will be touched by the fire (of Hell).\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1308:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1308:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1308:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001524",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1524",
      "hadith_number": "1524",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: \"ومن وقاه الله شر ما بين لحييه، وشر ما بين رجليه دخل الجنة\".",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) nakledildiğine göre, Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Ağzının ve cinsel organının kötülüklerinden Allah’ın koruduğu kimse, cennete girer.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"He whom Allah saves from the evil of that which is between his jaws and the evil of that which is between his legs will enter Jannah.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1524:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1524:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1524:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001821",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1821",
      "hadith_number": "1821",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن المغيرة بن شعبة رضي الله عنه قال: ما سأل أحد رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم عن الدجال أكثر مما سألته؛ وإنه قال لي: \"مايضرك؟ \"قلت: إنهم يقولون: إن معه جبل خبز ونهر ماء! قال: \"هو أهون على الله من ذلك\"",
      "text_tr": "İmrân b. Husayn (ra), Resûlullah’ın şöyle söylediğini işittim demiştir: Âdem’in yaratıldığı zamandan kıyamete kadar, Deccal’dan daha büyük bir olay yoktur.",
      "text_en": "Al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah (May Allah be pleased with him) said: No one asked the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) more about Dajjal than I asked him. He said to me, \"He will not harm you.\" I said: \"O Messenger of Allah, it is reported that he will have with him a mountain of bread and a river full of water.\" Thereupon he said, \"He (Dajjal) is far too worthless and insignificant near Allah (to let him deceive the believers).\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1821:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1821:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1821:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000599",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 599",
      "hadith_number": "599",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"ما بعث الله نبياً إلا رعى الغنم” فقال أصحابه: أنت؟ قال: كنت أرعاها على قراريط لأهل مكة”.",
      "text_tr": "Sa’d b. Ebû Vakkâs’ın (ra) işittiğine göre Allah Resûlü şöyle demiştir: Allah, muttaki, (gönlü) zengin, kendi işiyle ve ibadetiyle meşgul olan kulunu sever.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Every Prophet has tended sheep\". He was asked: \"And did you?\" He replied, \"Yes, I tended them for a few carats for the Makkans.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/599:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/599:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/599:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000891",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 891",
      "hadith_number": "891",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن البراء رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"ما من مسلمين يلتقيان فيتصافحان إلا غفر لهما قبل أن يفترقا\"",
      "text_tr": "Berâ’dan (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah : İki Müslüman birbiriyle karşılaşıp da el sıkışırlarsa, ayrılmadan evvel günahları bağışlanır, buyurmuştur.",
      "text_en": "Al-Bara' (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Two Muslims will not meet and shake hands without having their sins forgiven (by Allah ) before they depart.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/891:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/891:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/891:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001807",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1807",
      "hadith_number": "1807",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "عن سعد بن أبي وقاص رضي الله عنه أن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"من ادعى إلى غير أبيه وهو يعلم أنه غير أبيه، فالجنة عليه حرام\"",
      "text_tr": "Hz. Ali’nin (ra) işittiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Ergenlik çağından sonra yetimlik söz konusu değildir. Bütün gün geceye kadar da susmak yoktur.",
      "text_en": "Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"He who (falsely) attributes his fatherhood to anyone besides his real father, knowing that he is not his father, will be forbidden to enter Jannah.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1807:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1807:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1807:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000814",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 814",
      "hadith_number": "814",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "عن معاوية رضى الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"لا تركبوا الخز ولا النمار\".",
      "text_tr": "Muâviye’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: (Kibirden kaçınmak için) atlasla veya kaplan derisi ile kaplanmış eyer üzerine binmeyin.",
      "text_en": "Mu`awiyah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Do not ride on saddles made from silk or leopard's skin.\" .",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/814:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/814:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/814:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001274",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1274",
      "hadith_number": "1274",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عائشة رضي الله عنها أن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم كان يعتكف العشر الأواخر من رمضان، حتى توفاه الله، تعالى ثم اعتكف أزواجه من بعده.",
      "text_tr": "Hz. Âişe’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Hz. Peygamber , vefatına kadar, ramazanın son on gününde itikaf ederdi. Vefatından sonra da eşleri itikafa devam etti.",
      "text_en": "'Aishah (May Allah be pleased with her) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) used to engage himself in I'tikaf (seclusion for prayers) in the mosque during the last ten nights of Ramadan till he passed away; thereafter, his wives followed this practice after him.",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1274:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1274:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1274:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001225",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1225",
      "hadith_number": "1225",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنه أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"صوموا لرؤيته، وأفطروا لرؤيته، فإن غَبِيَ عليكم فأكملوا عدة شعبان ثلاثين\" وفي رواية مسلم: \"فإن غم عليكم فصوموا ثلاثين يومًا\".",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah : Ramazan geldiğinde cennet kapıları açılır, cehennem kapıları kapanır. Şeytanlar da bağlanır, demiştir.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Observe Saum (fast) on sighting the crescent and terminate it on sighting it (the new moon), but if the sky is cloudy before you, then complete the number (thirty days) of the month.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1225:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1225:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1225:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001819",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1819",
      "hadith_number": "1819",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عمران بن حصين رضي الله عنهما قال: سمعت رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم يقول: \"ما بين خلق آدم إلى قيام الساعة أمر أكبر من الدجال\".",
      "text_tr": "Yine Enes’in (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: İsfahan Yahudilerinden taylasan (denilen başlık) giymiş yetmiş bin kişi Deccal’e uyacak.",
      "text_en": "'Imran bin Hussain (May Allah be pleased with them) reported: I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying, \"Between time of the creation of Adam and the Resurrection Day, there is nothing greater than the mischief of Dajjal (the Antichrist).\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1819:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1819:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1819:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000317",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 317",
      "hadith_number": "317",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنه عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \" رغم أنف، ثم رغم أنف، ثم رغم أنف من أدرك أبويه عند الكبر، أحدهما أو كليهما، فلم يدخل الجنة\"",
      "text_tr": "Enes’ten (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Rızkının bol olmasını ve ömrünün uzun olmasını isteyen kimse, akrabalık ilişkilerini gözetsin.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"May he be disgraced! May he be disgraced! May he be disgraced, whose parents, one or both, attain old age during his life time, and he does not enter Jannah (by rendering being dutiful to them)\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/317:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/317:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/317:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000896",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 896",
      "hadith_number": "896",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي ذر، رضي الله عنه، قال: قال لي رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"لا تحقرن من المعروف شيئاً، ولو أن تلقي أخاك بوجه طلق\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Zer’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre o şöyle demiştir: Resûlullah , bana “Kardeşini güler yüzle karşılamak dahi olsa yapacağın hiçbir iyiliği küçümseme.” dedi.",
      "text_en": "Abu Dharr (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said to me, \"Do not belittle any good deed, even your meeting with your brother (Muslim) with a cheerful face.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/896:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/896:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/896:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001554",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1554",
      "hadith_number": "1554",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أسماء رضي الله عنها أن امرأة قالت: يا رسول الله إن لي ضَّرة فهل علي جناح إن تشبعت من زوجي غير الذي يعطيني؟ فقال النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"المتشبع بما لم يعطَ كلابس ثوبي زور\" المتشبع: هو الذي يظهر الشبع وليس بشبعان، ومعناها هنا أنه يظهر أنه حصل له فضيلة وليست حاصلة ولابس ثوبي زور أي: ذي زور وهو الذي يزور على الناس بأن يتزي بزي أهل الزهد أو العلم أو الثروة ليغتر به الناس وليس هو بتلك الصفة وقيل غير ذلك والله أعلم",
      "text_tr": "Semure’den (ra) gelen rivayete göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Yalan olduğunu bildiği bir sözü benden nakleden de, yalancılardan biridir.",
      "text_en": "Asma' (May Allah be pleased with her) reported: A woman came to the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) and said: \"I have a co-wife. \"Is there any harm for me if I give her the false impression of getting something from my husband which he has not in fact given me?\" The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"The one who creates a false impression of receiving what one has not been given is like one who wears two garments of falsehood.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1554:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1554:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1554:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001082",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1082",
      "hadith_number": "1082",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن جابر رضي الله عنه قال: سمعت رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم يقول: \"إن بين الرجل وبين الشرك والكفر ترك الصلاة\"",
      "text_tr": "Câbir’in (ra) işittiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle demiştir: Kişi ile şirk ve küfür arasında (engel olarak) namaz vardır (ve namazın terk edilmesiyle bu engel kalkar).",
      "text_en": "Jabir (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Between a man and disbelief and paganism is the abandonment of Salat (prayer).\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1082:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1082:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1082:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000759",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 759",
      "hadith_number": "759",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن جابر رضى الله عنه قال: سمعت رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم يقول: \"طعام الواحد يكفى الاثنين، وطعام الاثنين يكفى الأربعة، وطعام الأربعة يكفى الثمانية\".",
      "text_tr": "Câbir (ra) şöyle demiştir: Resûlullah’ın , “Bir kişilik yemek iki kişiye, iki kişilik yemek dört kişiye, dört kişilik yemek de sekiz kişiye yeter.” dediğini işittim.",
      "text_en": "Jabir bin 'Abdullah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"The food of one person suffices for two, the food of two persons suffices for four persons, and the food of four persons suffices for eight persons.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/759:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/759:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/759:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001667",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1667",
      "hadith_number": "1667",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن النعمان بن بشير رضي الله عنه قال: أغمي على عبد الله بن رواحة رضي الله عنه فجعلت أخته تبكي، وتقول: واجبلاه، وا كذا وا كذا: تعدد عليه فقال حين أفاق: ما قلت شيئًا ألا قيل لي :أنت كذلك؟!",
      "text_tr": "Muğîre b. Şu’be’nin (ra) işittiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Ardından feryat edilerek ağlanan ölüye, bu feryat sebebiyle kıyamet günü azap edilir, buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "An-Nu'man bin Bashir (May Allah be pleased with them) said: When 'Abdullah bin Rawahah (May Allah be pleased with him) became unconscious, his sister began to weep and shout: \"Alas! For the mountain among men. Alas! for such and such (mentioning his virtuous qualities).\" When he recovered his consciousness, he said: \"I was asked (disapprovingly, by the angels) about everything you said concerning me whether I am as you said.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1667:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1667:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1667:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000453",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 453",
      "hadith_number": "453",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن عمر، رضي الله عنهما، قال: لما اشتد برسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم، وجعه، قيل له في الصلاة، فقال: مروا أبا بكر فليصل بالناس\" فقالت عائشة، رضي الله عنها : إن أبا بكر رجل رقيق، إذا قرأ القرآن غلبه البكاء، فقال : \"مروه فليصل\". وفي رواية عن عائشة، رضي الله عنها، قالت: قلت: إن أبا بكر إذا قام مقامك لم يسمع الناس من البكاء.",
      "text_tr": "Abdullah b. Şıhhîr (ra) şöyle demiştir: Bir gün Resûlullah’ın yanına gelmiştim. Namaz kılıyordu ve ağlamaktan dolayı göğsü, (âdeta) kaynayan kazan gibi ses çıkarıyordu.",
      "text_en": "Ibn 'Umar (May Allah be pleased with them) reported: When the illness of Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) became serious, he was asked about the leading of Salat and he said, \"Ask Abu Bakr to lead Salat.\" Whereupon, 'Aishah (May Allah be pleased with her) said; \"Abu Bakr is very tender hearted. He is bound to be overcome by weeping when he recites the Qur'an.\" Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) repeated, \"Ask him (Abu Bakr) to lead Salat\".In another narration: 'Aishah (May Allah be pleased with her) said: \"When Abu Bakr stands in your place, he will not be able to recite the Noble Qur'an to the people on account of weeping.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/453:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/453:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/453:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000631",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 631",
      "hadith_number": "631",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن عباس رضي الله عنهما قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم لأشج عبد القيس: “إن فيك خصلتين يحبهما الله: الحلم والأناة”.",
      "text_tr": "Hz. Âişe’nin (ra) Resûlullah’tan şöyle işittiği bildirilmiştir: Mümin güzel ahlâkı sayesinde, gündüzlerini oruçla, gecelerini namazla geçiren kişinin derecesine ulaşır.",
      "text_en": "Ibn 'Abbas (May Allah be pleased with them) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said to Ashaj Abdul-Qais (May Allah be pleased with him), \"You possess two qualities that Allah loves. These are clemency and tolerance.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/631:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/631:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/631:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000301",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 301",
      "hadith_number": "301",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عمرو بن شعيب، عن أبيه، عن جده رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \" مروا أولادكم بالصلاة وهم أبناء سبع سنين، واضربوهم عليها، وهم أبناء عشر، وفرقوا بينهم في المضاجع\"",
      "text_tr": "İbn Ömer ve Hz. Âişe’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Cebrail bana komşu hakkında o kadar tavsiyede bulundu ki, onu mirasçı kılacak sandım.",
      "text_en": "'Amr bin Shu'aib reported on his father's authority that his grandfather (May Allah be pleased with him) said: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Command your children to perform Salat (prayer) when they are seven years old, and beat them for (not offering) it when they are ten, and do not let (boys and girls) sleep together\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/301:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/301:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/301:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000591",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 591",
      "hadith_number": "591",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي سروعة -كسر السين المهملة ونصبها- عقبة بن الحارث رضي الله عنه أنه تزوج ابنة لأبي إهاب بن عزيز، فأتته امرأة فقالت: إنى قد أرضعت عقبة والتى قد تزوج بها، فقال لها عقبة: ما أعلم أنك أرضعتني ولا أخبرتني فركب إلى رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم بالمدينة فسأله فقال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: “كيف، وقد قيل؟!” ففارقها عقبة ونكحت زوجاً غيره”.",
      "text_tr": "Enes’ten (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre, Hz. Peygamber yolda (terk edilmiş) bir hurma (salkımı) gördü ve: Sadaka olma ihtimalinden çekinmeseydim, onu alır yerdim, buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "'Uqbah bin Al-Harith (May Allah be pleased with him) reported that he had married a daughter of Abu Ihab bin 'Aziz and a woman came to him and said she had suckled both 'Uqbah and the woman whom he had married, to which he replied: \"I am not aware that you suckled me, and you did not inform me.\" So he ('Uqbah) rode to Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) in Al-Madinah and put the matter before him. The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"How can you continue (to be her husband) after what you have been told?\" 'Uqbah (May Allah be pleased with him) therefore divorced her and she married another man.",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/591:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/591:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/591:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001863",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1863",
      "hadith_number": "1863",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنها رضي الله عنها عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"من مات وعليه صوم، صام عنه وليه\"",
      "text_tr": "Amr b. Âs (ra), Resûlullah’ın şöyle buyurduğunu işittim, demiştir: Hâkim, içtihat eder de doğru hüküm verirse iki sevap; hata ederse (içtihadından dolayı) bir sevap alır.",
      "text_en": "'Aishah (May Allah be pleased with her) said: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"If a person dies without observing Saum (fasts), his Wali should make it up on his behalf.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1863:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1863:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1863:en",
