        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001665",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1665",
      "hadith_number": "1665",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن المغيرة بن شعبة رضي الله عنه قال :سمعت رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم يقول \"من نِيح عليه، فإنه يُعذب بما نِيح عليه يوم القيامة\"",
      "text_tr": "İbn Mes’ûd’dan (ra) nakledildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Ölüye yas tutarken, elleriyle yanaklarını dövüp yakalarını yırtan ve Câhiliye çığırtkanlığı yapan bizden değildir.",
      "text_en": "Al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah (May Allah be pleased with him) said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying, \"He who allows (others) to wail over his death, will be punished for it on the Day of Resurrection.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1665:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1665:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1665:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001395",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1395",
      "hadith_number": "1395",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"من سئل عن علم فكتمه ألجم يوم القيامة بلجام من نار\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Kendisine bir bilgi sorulduğu hâlde, bilgisini gizleyen kimsenin ağzına kıyamet günü ateşten bir gem vurulur.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"He who is asked about knowledge (of religion) and conceals it, will be bridled with a bridle of fire on the Day of Resurrection.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1395:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1395:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1395:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001713",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1713",
      "hadith_number": "1713",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عبد الرحمن بن سَمُرَة، رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"لا تحلفوا بالطواغي، ولا بآبائكم\". \"الطواغي\": جمع طاغية، وهي الأصنام، ومنه الحديث: \"هذه طاغية دوس\": أي: صنمهم ومعبودهم، وروي في غير مسلم: \"بالطواغيت\" جمع طاغوت، وهو الشيطان والصنم.",
      "text_tr": "Ümmü Seleme’nin (ra) naklettiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Kurbanı olan kimse, Zilhicce ayının girişinden, kurbanı kesinceye kadar saçından ve tırnağından hiçbir şey kesmesin.",
      "text_en": "'Abdur-Rahman bin Samurah (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Swear neither by the name of Taghut (i.e., false deities, false leaders, etc.) nor by your fathers.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1713:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1713:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1713:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000067",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 67",
      "hadith_number": "67",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "الثامن: عن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \" من حسن إسلام المرء تركه ما لا يعنيه\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Kendisini ilgilendirmeyen ve faydası olmayan (mâlâyâni) şeyleri terk etmesi, kişinin iyi Müslüman oluşundandır.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"It is from the excellence of (a believer's) Islam that he should shun that which is of no concern to him\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/67:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/67:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/67:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000253",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 253",
      "hadith_number": "253",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي العباس سهل بن سعد الساعدي رضي الله عنه قال: مر رجل على النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم، فقال لرجل عنده جالس: \"ما رأيك في هذا؟\" فقال: رجل من أشراف الناس، هذا والله حري إن خطب أن ينكح، وإن شفع أن يشفع . فسكت رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم، ثم مر رجل آخر، فقال له رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: \" ما رأيك في هذا؟\" فقال: يا رسول الله هذا رجل من فقراء المسلمين هذا حري إن خطب أن لا ينكح، وإن شفع أن لا يشفع، وإن قال أن لا يسمع لقوله. فقال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: “هذا خير من ملء الأرض مثل هذا\" (22)",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Kıyamet gününde iri, şişman bir adam gelir ki, onun Allah yanında bir sineğin kanadı kadar bile kıymeti yoktur. (B4729 Buhârî, Tefsîr, (Kehf) 6; M7045 Müslim, Münâfikîn, 18)",
      "text_en": "Sahl bin Sa'd As-Sa'idi (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: A man passed by the Prophet (ﷺ), so he asked a man who was sitting near him, \"What is your opinion about this man?\" That man replied: \"He is one of the noblest men. By Allah he is certainly a proper person for (a girl) being given in marriage if he seeks to marry, and his recommendation is fit to be accepted if he recommends\". Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) remained silent. Then another man passed. Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) enquired, \"What is your opinion about this man?\" He replied: \"O Messenger of Allah, he is one of the poor Muslims. He is not a proper person (for a girl) to be given in marriage to, and his recommendation would not be accepted if he makes one; if he speaks, he is not to be listened to.\" Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"He is better than the former by earthfuls\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/253:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/253:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/253:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000534",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 534",
      "hadith_number": "534",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ثوبان رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: \"من تكفل لي أن لا يسأل الناس شيئاً، وأتكفل له الجنة؟\" فقلت: أنا؛ فكان لا يسأل أحداً شيئاً،",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Servet toplamak için halktan dilenen, hakikatte ateş koru istiyor demektir; artık ister az, ister çok dilensin.",
      "text_en": "Thauban (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"He who guarantees me that he will not beg anything from anyone, I will guarantee him (to enter) Jannah.\" I said, \"I give you the guarantee.\" Then Thauban (May Allah be pleased with him) never begged anything from anyone.",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/534:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/534:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/534:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000627",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 627",
      "hadith_number": "627",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنه قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: “أكمل المؤمنين إيماناً أحسنهم خلقاً وخياركم خياركم لنسائهم”.",
      "text_tr": "Abdullah b. Amr b. Âs (ra) şöyle demiştir: Resûlullah ne çirkin söz söyler, ne de çirkin bir davranışa yeltenirdi. O, “Sizin en hayırlılarınız, ahlâkı en güzel olanlarınızdır.” buyururdu.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"The most perfect man in his faith among the believers is the one whose behaviour is most excellent; and the best of you are those who are the best to their wives.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/627:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/627:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/627:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001570",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1570",
      "hadith_number": "1570",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عبد الله بن عمرو بن العاص رضي الله عنهما قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"المسلم من سلم المسلمون من لسانه ويده، والمهاجر من هجر ما نهى الله عنه\"",
      "text_tr": "Yine Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) Resûlullah’ın şöyle buyurduğu rivayet edilmiştir: Kölesine (uşağına) zina iftirası atan kimseye, kıyamet günü zina cezası uygulanır. Şayet dediği gibiyse, o başka!",
      "text_en": "'Abdullah bin 'Amr bin Al-'As (May Allah be pleased with them) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"A (true) Muslim is one from whose tongue and hand the Muslims are safe; and a Muhajir (Emigrant) is he who leaves the deeds which Allah has prohibited.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1570:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1570:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1570:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001870",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1870",
      "hadith_number": "1870",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \" قال رجل لأتصدقن بصدقة، فخرج بصدقته، فوضعها في يد سارق، فأصبحوا يتحدثون: تصدق على سارق! فقال: اللهم لك الحمد لأتصدقن بصدقة، فخرج بصدقته، فوضعها في يد زانية؟! فأصبحوا يتحدثون: تصدق على زانية فقال: اللهم لك الحمد على زانية، لأتصدقن بصدقة، فخرج بصدقته، فوضعها في يد غني, فأصبحوا يتحدثون! تصدق الليلة على غني, فقال: اللهم لك الحمد على سارق ، وعلى زانية، وعلى غني! فأتى فقيل له: أما صدقتك على سارق، فلعله أن يستعف عن سرقته، وأما الزانية فلعلها تستعف عن زناها، وأما الغني فلعله أن يعتبر، فينفق مما آتاه الله\"",
      "text_tr": "Ümmü Şerik’in (ra) anlattığına göre Resûlullah ona, (zehirli ve zararlı bir tür olan) büyük keleri öldürmesini emretmiş ve (şaka yollu) “o, İbrahim’in (as) üzerine ateş üflerdi.” buyurmuştur.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"A man (from amongst the people before you) said: 'Indeed! I will give in charity.' So he took his Sadaqah out and placed it in a thief's hand. In the morning the people were talking (about this incident) and saying: 'Sadaqah was given to a thief last night.' The man said: 'O Allah! Praise be to You. I have given Sadaqah to a thief. Indeed, I will give in charity!' So he took his Sadaqah out and he placed it in a prostitute's hand. In the morning the people were talking (about this incident) and saying: 'Sadaqah was given to a prostitute last night.' On hearing this, the man said: 'Praise be to You, O Allah! I gave Sadaqah to a prostitute. Indeed, I will give in charity!' So he took his Sadaqah out and placed it in a rich man's hand. In the morning the people were talking (about this incident) and saying: 'Sadaqah was given to a rich man last night.' The man said: 'O Allah! Praise be to You (for helping me) give charity to a thief, a prostitute and a rich man.' Then he had a dream in which he was told that his Sadaqah to the thief might result in his refraining from his theft, his Sadaqah to the prostitute might help her abstain from her immorality, and his Sadaqah to the rich man might help him pay heed and spend from what Allah had bestowed upon him.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1870:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1870:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1870:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000626",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 626",
      "hadith_number": "626",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبى هريرة رضي الله عنه قال: سئل رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم عن أكثر ما يدخل الناس الجنة؟ قال: “تقوى الله وحسن الخلق” وسئل عن أكثر ما يدخل الناس النار، قال: “الفم والفرج”.",
      "text_tr": "Nevvâs b. Sem’ân (ra) anlatıyor: Resûlullah’a iyilik ve günahı sordum. “İyilik ( birr ) güzel ahlâktır. Günah ise vicdanını rahatsız eden ve insanların bilmesini istemediğin şeydir.” buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) was asked about the deed which will be foremost to lead a man to Jannah. He replied, \"Fear of Allah and the good conduct.\" Then he was asked about indulgence which will admit a man to Hell (Fire) and he answered, \"The tongue and the genitals.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/626:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/626:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/626:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000670",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 670",
      "hadith_number": "670",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: “من أطاعني فقد أطاع الله، ومن عصاني فقد عصى الله، ومن يطع الأمير فقد أطاعني، ومن يعص الأمير فقد عصاني”",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Varlıkta, darlıkta, hoşnutluk ve hoşnutsuzluk hâlinde, hatta başkası sana tercih edildiğinde bile, dinle ve itaat et.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Whosoever obeys me, obeys Allah; and he who disobeys me, disobeys Allah; and whosoever obeys the Amir (leader), in fact, obeys me; and he who disobeys the Amir, in fact, disobeys me.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/670:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/670:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/670:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
