    {
      "id": "hadith_000663",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 663",
      "hadith_number": "663",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنه قال: كنا إذا بايعنا رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم على السمع والطاعة يقول لنا: “فيما استطعتم”",
      "text_tr": "Abdullah b. Amr b. Âs’tan (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle demiştir: Ailesi ve idaresi altında bulunanların hak ve hukukunda adaletle davrananlar, Allah katında nurdan koltuklara otururlar.",
      "text_en": "Ibn 'Umar (May Allah be pleased with them) reported: Whenever we took a pledge of allegiance to Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) to hear and obey, he (ﷺ) would say to us, \"As far as you are capable of.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/663:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/663:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/663:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
