    {
      "id": "hadith_000688",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 688",
      "hadith_number": "688",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "عن أبى سعيد الخدرى رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: \"إن من شر الناس عند الله منزلة يوم القيامة الرجل يفضي إلى المرأة وتفضي إليه ثم ينشر سرها\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Saîd el-Hudrî’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Kıyamet günü, Allah nezdinde derecesi en kötü olan insan, karı-koca olduktan sonra eşinin (yataktaki) sırlarını yayandır.",
      "text_en": "Abu Sa'id Al-Khudri (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"The most evil of the people to Allah on the Day of Resurrection will be the man who consorts with his wife and then publicizes her secret.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/688:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/688:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/688:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
