    {
      "id": "hadith_000897",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 897",
      "hadith_number": "897",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه قال: قبل النبي،صلى الله عليه وسلم الحسن بن على، رضي الله عنهما، فقال الأقرع بن حابس: إن لي عشرة من الولد ما قبلت منهم أحداً. فقال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"من لا يرحم لا يرحم!\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre (ra) anlatıyor: Peygamber , Ali’nin oğlu Hasan’ı (ra) öptü. Bunun üzerine Akrâ’ b. Hâbis’in: –Benim on çocuğum var, bunlardan birini bile öpmedim, demesi üzerine Resûlullah : –Merhamet etmeyene, merhamet edilmez, buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) kissed his grandson Hasan bin 'Ali in the presence of Aqra' bin Habis. Thereupon Aqra' remarked: \"I have ten children and I have never kissed any one of them.\" The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) cast a glance upon him and said, \"He who does not show mercy to others, will not be shown mercy.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/897:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/897:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/897:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000433",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 433",
      "hadith_number": "433",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن عمر رضي الله عنهما قال: سمعت رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم، يقول: يدنى المؤمن يوم القيامة من ربه حتى يضع كنفه عليه، فيقرره بذنوبه، فيقول: أتعرف ذنب كذا؟ أتعرف ذنب كذا؟ فيقول: رب أعرف قال: فإني قد سترتها عليك في الدنيا، وأنا أغفرها لك اليوم، فيعطى صحيفة حسناته\" ((كنفه: ستره ورحمته)).",
      "text_tr": "İbn Abbâs’ın (ra) Resûlullah’tan şöyle işittiği nakledilmiştir: Bir Müslüman ölür de Allah’a ortak koşmayan kırk kişi onun cenaze namazını kılarsa, Allah onların (bu şahitlikleri sebebiyle) (onun hakkındaki) şefaatlerini kabul eder.",
      "text_en": "Ibn 'Umar (May Allah be pleased with them) reported: I heard Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying, \"A believer will be brought close to his Rubb on the Day of Resurrection and enveloping him in His Mercy, He (SWT) will make him confess his sins by saying: 'Do you remember (doing) this sin and this sin?' He will reply: 'My Rubb, I remember.' Then He (SWT) will say: 'I covered it up for you in the life of world, and I forgive it for you today.' Then the record of his good deeds will be handed to him\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/433:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/433:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/433:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001671",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1671",
      "hadith_number": "1671",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي موسى رضي الله عنه أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"ما من ميت يموت، فيقوم باكيهم، فيقول: واجبلاه، وأسيداه، أو نحو ذلك إلا وكل به ملكان يلهزانه: أهكذا كنت؟!\". رواه الترمذي وقال حديث حسن. «اللَّهْزُ»: الدَّفْعُ بِجُمْعِ اليَدِ فِي الصَّدْرِ.",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Mâlik el-Eş’arî’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Cenazeye ağıt yakan ağıtçı kadın, ölmeden evvel tövbe etmezse kıyamet günü üzerinde katrandan bir gömlek ve uyuzlu bir giysi olduğu hâlde diriltilir.",
      "text_en": "Abu Musa (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"If anyone dies and the mourner gets up and says: 'Alas! For the mountain among men. Alas! For the chief ..' and such like, Allah will put two angels in charge of him who will beat on the breast and ask him (disapproving): 'Were you like that?' \".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1671:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1671:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1671:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001502",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1502",
      "hadith_number": "1502",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن جابر رضي الله عنهما قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: \"لا تدعوا على أنفسكم، ولا تدعوا على أولادكم، ولا تدعو على أموالكم، لا توافقوا من الله ساعة يسأل فيها عطاء، فيستجيب لكم\"",
      "text_tr": "Câbir’den (ra) nakledildiğine göre, Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Kendinize beddua etmeyin, evlatlarınıza beddua etmeyin ve mallarınıza da beddua etmeyin. Duaların kabul olunacağı bir saate rastlarsınız da, bedduanız kabul ediliverir.",
      "text_en": "Jabir (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Do not invoke curses on yourself or on your children or on your possessions lest you should happen to do it at a moment when the supplications are accepted, and your prayer might be granted.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1502:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1502:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1502:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000177",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 177",
      "hadith_number": "177",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "عن أبي عبد الرحمن زيد بن خالد الجهني رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"من جهز غازياً في سبيل الله فقد غزا ومن خلف غازيا في أهله بخير فقد غزا\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Saîd el-Hudrî’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Allah Resûlü , Hüzeyloğullarından Lihyân kabilesine asker göndermek istemiş ve şöyle demiştir: Her iki erkekten biri gazaya gitsin (diğeri evde kalsın); sevabı ikisi arasında ortaktır.",
      "text_en": "Khalid Al-Juhani (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"He who equips a warrior in the way of Allah (will get the reward of the one who has actually gone for Jihad); and he who looks after the family of a warrior in the way of Allah will get the reward of the one who has gone for Jihad\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/177:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/177:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/177:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001602",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1602",
      "hadith_number": "1602",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"لا يحل لمؤمن أن يهجر مؤمنًا فوق ثلاث، فإن مرت به ثلاث، فليلقه، وليسلم عليه، فإن رد عليه السلام، فقد اشتركا في الأجر، وإن لم يرد عليه، فقد باء بالإثم، وخرج المسلم من الهجرة\".",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Bir Müslümanın Müslüman kardeşine üç günden fazla küs durması helâl olmaz. Bir kimse üç günden fazla küs durur ve (bunda ısrar ederek) ölürse, cehenneme girer.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"It is not permissible for a believer to forsake his (Muslim) brother for more than three days. If three days have passed, he should meet him and greet him; and if other responds to it they will both share the reward; but if he does not respond, he will bear his sin and the one who (has taken the initiative to) greet (the other) will be absolved of the sin of forsaking (one's brother in Faith).\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1602:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1602:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1602:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001835",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1835",
      "hadith_number": "1835",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن عمر رضي الله عنهما قال : قال رسولُ اللهِ : « إذَا أنْزَلَ اللهُ تَعَالَى بِقَومٍ عَذَاباً ، أصَابَ العَذَابُ مَنْ كَانَ فِيهِمْ ، ثُمَّ بُعِثُوا عَلَى أَعْمَالِهِمْ »",
      "text_tr": "Mirdâs (b. Mâlik) el-Eslemî’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Hz. Peygamber şöyle buyurmuştur: Salih kimseler peşpeşe (dünyadan) gider ve (geride) arpa ve hurma döküntüleri gibi, halkın döküntüsü kalır. Allah da onlara pek değer vermez.",
      "text_en": "Ibn 'Umar (May Allah be pleased with them) said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"If Allah afflicts punishment upon a nation, it befalls the whole population indiscriminately and then they will be resurrected and judged according to their deeds.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1835:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1835:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1835:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001601",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1601",
      "hadith_number": "1601",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي خراش حدرد بن أبي حدرد الأسلمي، ويقال السلمي الصحابي رضي الله عنه أنه سمع النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم يقول: \"من هجر أخاه سنة فهو كسفك دمه\".",
      "text_tr": "Câbir’in (ra) işittiğine göre Resûlullah , şöyle buyurmuştur: Şeytan, Arap Yarımadası’nda namaz kılanların kendisine (putlara) tapacaklarına dair ümidini yitirdi. Fakat onların aralarına düşmanlık, bozgunculuk düşürme ümidi hâlâ vardır.",
      "text_en": "Abu Khirash Hadrad bin Abu Hadrad Al-Aslami (May Allah be pleased with him) said: I heard the Prophet (ﷺ) saying, \"Whosoever forsakes his brother for a year is like one who sheds his blood.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1601:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1601:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1601:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001208",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1208",
      "hadith_number": "1208",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عائشة رضي الله عنها قالت: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"عشر من الفطرة: قص الشارب، وإعفاء اللحية، والسواك، واستنشاق الماء، وقص الأظفار، وغسل البراجم، ونتف الإبط، وحلق العانة، وانتقاص الماء\" ((قال الراوي: ونسيت العاشرة إلا أن تكون المضمضة، قال: وكيع- وهو أحد رواته-)) . (25) (( (26)",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Hz. Peygamber şöyle demiştir: Fıtrat, şu beş şeydir, veya şu beş şey fıtrattandır: Sünnet olmak, kasık kıllarını temizlemek, tırnakları kesmek, koltuk altını temizlemek, bıyıkları kısaltmak.",
      "text_en": "'Aishah (May Allah be pleased with her) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"There are ten demands of pure nature: trimming the moustache, letting the beard grow, using Miswak (tooth-stick), snuffing up water into the nose (in ablution), paring the nails, washing the bases of the finger joints; plucking the underarm hair, removing of the pubic hair and removing impurities with water from the affected part after a call of nature.\"The subnarrator said: I forgot the tenth but it might possibly be the rinsing of the mouth (in ablution).",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1208:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1208:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1208:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001685",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1685",
      "hadith_number": "1685",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن عباس رضي الله عنهما قال: سمعت رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم يقول: \"كل مصور في النار يجعل له بكل صورة صورها نفس فيعذبه في جهنم\" قال ابن عباس: فإن كنت لابد فاعلا، فاصنع الشجر وما لا ورح فيه\"",
      "text_tr": "Abdullah b. Ömer’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: (Tapılmak maksadıyla) bu suretleri (heykelleri) yapanlar, kıyamet gününde azap görecekler ve onlara, “Yarattığınız şeylere can verin, bakalım!” denilecektir.",
      "text_en": "Ibn 'Abbas (May Allah be pleased with them) said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying, \"Every painter will go to Hell, and for every portrait he has made, there will be appointed one who will chastise him in the Hell.\" Ibn 'Abbas said: If you have to do it, draw pictures of trees and other inanimate things.",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1685:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1685:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1685:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001572",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1572",
      "hadith_number": "1572",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أنس رضي الله عنه أن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"لا تباغضوا، ولا تحاسدوا ولا تدابروا، ولا تقاطعوا، وكونوا عباد الله إخوانًا، ولا يحل لمسلم أن يهجر أخاه فوق ثلاث\"",
      "text_tr": "Abdullah b. Amr b. Âs’tan (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: (Gerçek) müslüman, dilinden ve elinden Müslümanların güvende olduğu kimsedir. (Esas) muhacir (hicret eden) ise Allah’ın yasakladığı şeyleri terk edendir.",
      "text_en": "Anas bin Malik (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"Do not harbour grudge against one another, nor jealousy, nor enmity; and do not show your backs to one another; and become as fellow brothers and slaves of Allah. It is not lawful for a Muslim to avoid speaking with his brother beyond three days.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1572:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1572:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1572:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001543",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1543",
      "hadith_number": "1543",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن مسعود رضي الله عنه أن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: “ ألا أنبئكم ما العِضَه؟ هي النميمة، القالة بين الناس\" العضه: بفتح العين المهملة، وإسكان الضاد المعجمة، وبالهاء على وزن الوجه، وروي: العضة بكسر العين وفتح الضاد المعجمة على وزن العدة، وهي: الكذب والبهتان، وعلى الرواية الأولى: العضه مصدر، يقال: عضهه عضها، أي: رماه بالعضه .",
      "text_tr": "İbn Mes’ûd’dan (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Hz. Peygamber şöyle buyurdu: –Size “el-adhu” kelimesinin ne demek olduğunu söyleyeyim mi? O, insanların arasını bozmak için laf taşımaktır.",
      "text_en": "Ibn Mas'ud (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"Shall I tell you what 'Al-'Adhu' (falsehood and slandering) is? It is calumny which is committed among the people.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1543:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1543:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1543:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001235",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1235",
      "hadith_number": "1235",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن عمر رضي الله عنهما قال: كان لرسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم مؤذنان: بلال وابن أم مكتوم. فقال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم \" إن بلالا يؤذن بليل فكلوا واشربوا حتى يؤذن ابن أم مكتوم\" قال ولم يكن بينهما إلا أن ينزل هذا ويرقى هذا،",
      "text_tr": "Zeyd b. Sâbit’ten (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre o, şöyle demiştir: Biz Resûlullah ile sahur yemeği yedik, sonra sabah namazını kıldık. –Namaz ile sahur arasında ne kadar zaman geçti, diye sordular. –Elli âyet okuyacak kadar, cevabını verdi.",
      "text_en": "Ibn 'Umar (May Allah be pleased with them) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) had two Mu'adhdhin: Bilal and Ibn Umm Maktum (May Allah be pleased with them). The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Bilal proclaims Adhan .",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1235:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1235:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1235:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001394",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1394",
      "hadith_number": "1394",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن مسعود رضي الله عنه قال: سمعت رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم يقول: \"نضر الله امرءًا سمع منا شيئًا فبلغه كما سمعه فرب مبلغ أوعي من سامع\"",
      "text_tr": "İbn Mes’ûd’un (ra) işittiğine göre, Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Allah, bizden işittiğini, işittiği gibi başkasına ileten kimsenin yüzünü ak etsin. Kendisine bilgi iletilen nice kimse, bizzat o bilgiyi dinleyenden daha kavrayışlı olabilir.",
      "text_en": "Ibn Mas'ud (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying, \"May Allah freshen the affairs of a person who hears something from us and communicates it to others exactly as he has heard it (i.e., both the meaning and the words), for it may be that the recipient of knowledge understands it better than the one who has heard it.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1394:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1394:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1394:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001826",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1826",
      "hadith_number": "1826",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنه رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \" والذي نفسي بيده لا تذهب الدنيا حتى يمر الرجل بالقبر، فيتمرغ عليه، ويقول: ياليتني مكان صاحب هذا القبر، وليس به الدين، ما به إلا البلاء\"",
      "text_tr": "İbn Ömer (ra) anlatıyor: Resûlullah , halkın arasında Deccal’den bahsederken şöyle buyurdu: İyi bilin ki Mesih-i Deccal’in sağ gözü pörtlektir, sanki salkımdan dışa fırlamış üzüm tanesi gibidir. Allah öyle değildir (noksanlardan münezzehtir).",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"By Him in Whose Hand my soul is, the world will not come to an end until a man passes by a grave and will lie over it saying, 'Would that I were in this grave (i.e., dead)!' Not he will say so because of religious reasons but because of widespread mischief and severe trials of this world.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1826:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1826:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1826:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001676",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1676",
      "hadith_number": "1676",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن عباس رضي الله عنهما قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"من اقتبس علمًا من النجوم، اقتبس شعبة من السحر زاد ما زاد\".",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Ubeyd’in kızı Safiyye’nin Hz. Peygamber’in hanımlarının bazılarından rivayetine göre Peygamber : “Arrâfa (kayıp ya da çalıntının yerini haber veren kimseye) bir şey sorup da onu tasdik eden kimsenin kırk gün namazı kabul olunmaz.” buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "Ibn 'Abbas (May Allah be pleased with them) said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"He who acquires a branch of the knowledge of astrology, learns a branch of magic (of which he acquires more as long as) he continues to do so.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1676:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1676:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1676:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000003",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 3",
      "hadith_number": "3",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عائشة رضي الله عنها قالت قال النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم: \" لا هجرة بعد الفتح، ولكن جهاد ونية، وإذا استنفرتم فانفروا\"",
      "text_tr": "Hz. Âişe’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Peygamber şöyle buyurmuştur: Mekke’nin fethinden sonra, artık (Medine’ye) hicret etmek yoktur. Yalnız cihad etmek ve cihad niyetinde bulunmak vardır. Cihada çağrıldığınız zaman derhal (orduya) katılın.",
      "text_en": "A'ishah (May Allah be pleased with her) narrated that the Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"There is no emigration after the conquest (of Makkah) but only Jihad .",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/3:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/3:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/3:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000586",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 586",
      "hadith_number": "586",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن قيس بن أبي حازم قال: دخلنا على خباب بن الأرت رضي الله عنه نعوده وقد اكتوى سبع كيات فقال: إن أصحابنا الذين سلفوا مضوا، ولم تنقصهم الدنيا، وإنا أصبنا ما لا نجد له موضعاً إلا التراب ولولا أن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم نهاناً أن ندعوا بالموت لدعوت به، ثم أتيناه مرة أخرى وهو يبنى حائطاً له فقال: إن المسلم ليؤجر فى كل شئ ينفقه إلا فى شئ يجعله فى هذا التراب.",
      "text_tr": "İbn Abbâs (ra) anlatıyor: Resûlullah Medine’de bir kabristana uğradı ve yüzünü onlara dönerek şöyle dedi: “Ey bu kabirlerde yatanlar! Size selâm olsun. Allah, sizi de, bizi de bağışlasın. Siz, bizden önce gittiniz. Biz de peşinizden geleceğiz.”",
      "text_en": "Qais bin Abu Hazim (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: I went to visit Khabbab bin Aratt (May Allah be pleased with him) during his illness. He had been cauterized in seven places. He said: \"Our companions who have died have left (this world) without having enjoyed the pleasures of the world (in order to get a great full reward in the Hereafter) while we have amassed wealth exceeding our needs for which there is no place to keep except in the earth. Had Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) not prohibited us from longing for death, I would have prayed for it.\" Then we visited him again and he was building a wall. He said: \"There is a reward in store for a Muslim in respect of everything on which he spends except for something he places in the earth (i.e., something exceeding our needs or essentials).\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/586:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/586:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/586:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001309",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1309",
      "hadith_number": "1309",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: \"لا يلج النار رجل بكي من خشية الله حتى يعود اللبن في الضرع، ولا يجتمع على عبد غبار في سبيل الله ودخان جهنم\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah : Sağılan süt nasıl memeye tekrar girmezse, Allah korkusundan ağlayan kimse de cehenneme girmez; Allah yolundaki cihadın tozu ile cehennem dumanı bir kimse üzerinde birleşmez, buyurmuştur.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"No one who weeps out of Fear of Allah will enter Hell until milk recedes to the udder, and the dust endured while striving in the Cause of Allah and the smoke of Hell will never subsist together.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1309:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1309:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1309:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000331",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 331",
      "hadith_number": "331",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي أيوب خالد بن زيد الأنصاري رضي الله عنه أن رجلاً قال: يا رسول الله أخبرني بعمل يدخلني الجنة، ويباعدني من النار. فقال النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم: \"تعبد الله، ولاتشرك به شيئًا، وتقيم الصلاة، وتؤتي الزكاة، وتصل الرحم\"",
      "text_tr": "İbn Ömer (ra) anlatıyor: Bir eşim vardı ve ben onu çok seviyordum. (Babam) Ömer ise onu beğenmiyor ve boşamamı istiyordu. Ben de buna yanaşmıyordum. Bunun üzerine babam, Peygamber’e gelerek durumu arz etti. Peygamber de bana: –Ondan boşan, dedi.",
      "text_en": "Abu Ayyub Khalid bin Zaid Al-Ansari (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: A man came to Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) and said, \"Direct me to a deed which will admit me to Jannah and take me away from the Fire\". The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Worship Allah and associate no partner with Him, perform As-Salat, pay Zakat, and maintain the ties of kinship\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/331:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/331:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/331:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000915",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 915",
      "hadith_number": "915",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "عن عائشة رضي الله عنها قالت: سمعت النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم الله عليه وسلم الله عليه وسلم وهو مستند إلي يقول: اللهم اغفر لي وارحمني وألحقني بالرفيق الأعلى\"",
      "text_tr": "Hz. Âişe’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre o, şöyle demiştir: Peygamber’in bana yaslanarak: “ Allâhümmeğfir lî verhamnî ve elhıknî bi’r-Refîki’l-A’lâ (Allah’ım, bana mağfiret et. Bana rahmet et ve beni en Yüce Dost’a ulaştır). ” dediğini işittim.",
      "text_en": "`Aishah (May Allah be pleased with her) reported: While the Prophet (ﷺ) was reclining against me (during his last illness) I heard him saying: \"Allahumma-ghfir li, warhamni, wa alhiqni bir Rafiqil-A`la (O Allah, forgive me, bestow Your Mercy on me and let me join with the exalted companions.'' .",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/915:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/915:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/915:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
