        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001488",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1488",
      "hadith_number": "1488",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن شكل بن حميد، رضي الله عنه قال: قلت يا رسول الله: علمني دعاء. قال: \"قل: اللهم إني أعوذ بك من شر سمعي، ومن شر بصري، ومن شر لساني، ومن شر قلبي، ومن شر مني\"",
      "text_tr": "Şekel b. Humeyd’in (ra) şöyle dediği nakledilmiştir: –Ey Allah’ın Resûlü! Bana bir dua öğret, dedim. Resûlullah : –“Allah’ım, kulağım, gözüm, dilim, kalbim ve cinsel organım sebebiyle başıma gelebilecek kötülüklerden sana sığınırım, de!” buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "Shakal bin Humaid (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: I asked: \"O Messenger of Allah, teach me a prayer.\" He (ﷺ) said, \"Say: Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min sharri sam'i, wa min sharri basari, wa min sharri lisani, wa min sharri qalbi, wa min sharri maniyyi (O Allah! I seek refuge in You from the evils of my hearing, the evils of my seeing, the evils of my tongue; the evils of my heart and the evils of passions).\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1488:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1488:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1488:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000649",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 649",
      "hadith_number": "649",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عائشة رضي الله عنها قالت: قدم رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم من سفر وقد سترت سهوة لى بقرام فيه تماثيل، فلما رآه رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم هتكه وتلون وجهه وقال: “يا عائشة: أشد الناس عذابا عند الله يوم القيامة الذين يضاهون بخلق الله”",
      "text_tr": "İbn Mes’ûd (ra) anlatıyor: Resûlullah’ın Peygamberlerden birinin hâlini anlatışı hâlâ gözümün önündedir. Kavmi onu dövüp yaralamış; o ise yüzündeki kanları silerken şöyle diyormuş: “Allah’ım sen kavmimi bağışla; çünkü onlar (gerçeği) bilmiyorlar.”",
      "text_en": "'Aishah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) returned once from a journey, and saw a curtain which I had hung along a platform with some pictures on it. The colour of his face changed. He tore it up and said, \"O 'Aishah, the most tormented people on the Day of Resurrection are those who contend with Allah in terms of creation.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/649:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/649:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/649:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001726",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1726",
      "hadith_number": "1726",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "عن أبي قتادة رضي الله عنه أنه سمع رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم يقول: \"إياكم وكثرة الحلف في البيع، فإنه ينفق ثم يمحق\"",
      "text_tr": "Hz. Âişe’nin (ra) şöyle dediği rivayet edilmiştir: “Allah Teâlâ, boş yere yemin etmenizden dolayı sizi sorumlu tutmaz.” (mealindeki) âyeti , kişinin (kasıtsız bir şekilde ağzından kaçırdığı) “Hayır vallahi, evet vallahi!” demesi hakkında indirildi. (B4613 Buhârî, Tefsîr (Mâide), 8) Mâide, 5/89. riyaz3-85 Alışverişte Yemin Etmemek",
      "text_en": "Abu Qatadah (May Allah be pleased with him) said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying, \"Beware of excessive swearing in sale, because it may promote trade but this practice will eliminate the blessing.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1726:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1726:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1726:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000312",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 312",
      "hadith_number": "312",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "عن أبي عبد الرحمن عبد الله بن مسعود رضي الله عنه قال: سألت النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم : أي العمل أحب إلى الله تعالى؟ قال \" الصلاة على وقتها\" قلت: ثم أي؟ قال: \" بر الوالدين\" قلت: ثم أي؟ قال: \" الجهاد في سبيل الله\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Allah’a ve âhiret gününe inanan misafirine ikram etsin. Allah’a ve âhiret gününe inanan akrabasını gözetsin. Allah’a ve âhiret gününe inanan ya hayır söylesin ya da sussun.",
      "text_en": "'Abdullah bin Mas'ud (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: I asked the Prophet (ﷺ) , \"Which of the deeds is loved most by Allah?\" Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Salat at its proper time.\" I asked, ''What next?\" He (ﷺ) replied, ''Kindness to parents.\" I asked, ''What next?\" He replied, ''Jihad in the way of Allah.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/312:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/312:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/312:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001061",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1061",
      "hadith_number": "1061",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي موسى الأشعري رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: \"إن أعظم الناس أجرًا في الصلاة أبعدهم إليها ممشى، فأبعدهم، والذي ينتظر الصلاة حتى يصليها مع الإمام أعظم أجرًا من الذي يصليها ثم ينام\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Mûsâ’dan (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah : Namazda insanların en fazla sevap alanı, (evi) camiye en uzak olanıdır. İmam ile birlikte namazı kılmak için bekleyen kimse, tek başına namaz kılıp da uyuyan kimseden daha fazla sevap alır, demiştir.",
      "text_en": "Abu Musa (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"The person who will receive the highest reward for Salat (prayer) is the one who comes to perform it in the mosque from the farthest distance. And he who waits for Salat to perform it with the Imam (in congregation) will have a greater reward than the one who observes it alone and then goes to sleep.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1061:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1061:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1061:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000451",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 451",
      "hadith_number": "451",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أنس، رضي الله عنه ، قال: قال رسول الله، صلى الله عليه وسلم، لأبي بن كعب، رضي الله عنه : \"إن الله عز وجل أمرني أن أقرأ عليك: لم يكن الذين كفرو\" قال: وسماني؟ قال: “نعم” فبكى أبي. ((وفي رواية: فجعل أبي يبكى)).",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Sağılan süt nasıl memeye (tekrar) girmezse, Allah korkusundan ağlayan kimse de cehenneme girmez. Allah yolunda çarpışırken meydana gelen toz ile cehennemin dumanı bir araya gelmez.",
      "text_en": "Anas (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said to Ubayy bin Ka'b (May Allah be pleased with him), \"Allah (SWT) has ordered me to recite to you Surat-Al-Baiyyinah (98): 'Those who disbelieve ..\"Ubayy (May Allah be pleased with him) asked, \"Did He name me?\" Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) replied in the affirmative. Whereupon Ubayy (May Allah be pleased with him) began to weep.",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/451:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/451:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/451:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000320",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 320",
      "hadith_number": "320",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنه قال: كان أبو طلحة أكثر الأنصار بالمدينة مالاً من نخل، وكان أحب أمواله إليه بيرحاء، وكانت مستقبلة المسجد، وكان رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم يدخلها، ويشرب من ماء فيها طيب، فلما نزلت هذه الآية: {لن تنالوا البر حتى تنفقوا مما تحبون} ((آل عمران: 92)) قام أبو طلحة إلى رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم فقال: يا رسول الله إن الله تبارك وتعالى يقول: {لن تنالوا البر حتى تنفقوا مما تحبون} وإن أحب مالي إلي بيرحاء، وإنها صدقة لله تعالى، وأرجو برها وذخرها عند الله تعالى، فضعها يا رسول الله حيث أراك الله. فقال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: \"بخ! ذلك مال رابح، وذلك مال رابح! وقد سمعت ما قلت، وإني أرى أن تجعلها في الأقربين\" فقال أبو طلحة: أفعل يا رسول الله، فقسمها أبو طلحة في أقاربه وبني عمه. وسبق بيان ألفاظه في: باب الإنفاق مما يحب.",
      "text_tr": "Yine Abdullah b. Amr’dan (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Hz. Peygamber şöyle buyurmuştur: Akrabalarla ilişkiyi sürdüren, akrabasından gördüğü iyiliğe iyilikle karşılık veren kimse değil, akrabası kendisine iyiliği kestiğinde dahi onunla ilişkiyi sürdürendir.",
      "text_en": "Anas (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Abu Talhah (May Allah be pleased with him) was the richest among the Ansar of Al-Madinah and possessed the largest property; and among his possessions what he loved most was his garden known as Bairuha' which was opposite the mosque, and Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) often visited it and drank from its fresh water. When this ayah was revealed: \"By no means shall you attain Al-Birr (piety, righteousness - here it means Allah's reward, i.e., Jannah), unless you spend (in Allah's Cause) of that which you love,\" (3:92). Abu Talhah came to Messenger of Allah (ﷺ), and said: \"Allah says in His Book: 'By no means shall you attain Al-Birr, unless you spend (in Allah's Cause) of that which you love,' and the dearest of my property is Bairuha' so I have given it as Sadaqah (charity) for Allah's sake, and I anticipate its reward with Him; so spend it, O Messenger of Allah, as Allah guides you\". Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Well-done! That is profitable property. I have heard what you have said, but I think you should spend it on your nearest relatives.\" So Abu Talhah distributed it among his nearest relatives and cousins.",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/320:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/320:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/320:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000323",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 323",
      "hadith_number": "323",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عائشة قالت: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: \"الرحم معلقة بالعرش تقول: من وصلني، وصله الله، ومن قطعني، قطعه الله\"",
      "text_tr": "Esmâ bnt. Ebû Bekir’den (ra) anlatıyor: Müşrik olan annem, Resûlullah zamanında yanıma gelmişti. Resûlullah’a sordum ve dedim ki: –Annem geldi, beni özlemiş, ona evlatlık vazifemi yapabilir miyim? Resûlullah : –Evet, annene evlatlık vazifeni yap, buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "'Aishah (May Allah be pleased with her) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"The bond of relationship is suspending from the Throne, and says: 'He who keeps good relations with me, Allah will keep connection with him, but whosoever severs relations with me, Allah will sever connection with him\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/323:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/323:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/323:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000686",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 686",
      "hadith_number": "686",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "-وعن أبى هريرة رضي الله عنه، أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: “الإيمان بضع وسبعون، أو بضع وستون شعبة، فأفضلها قول لا إله إلا الله، وأدناها إماطة الأذى عن الطريق، والحياء شعبة من الإيمان”",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle demiştir: İman, yetmiş veya altmış küsur bölümdür; bunların en üstünü lâ ilâhe illâllah sözüdür. En aşağısı ise geçenlere sıkıntı veren şeyleri yoldan kaldırmaktır. Hayâ da imanın bir bölümüdür.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Iman has sixty odd or seventy odd branches. The uppermost of all these is the Testimony of Faith: 'La ilaha illallah' (there is no true god except Allah) while the least of them is the removal of harmful object from the road. And shyness is a branch of Iman.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/686:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/686:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/686:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000619",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 619",
      "hadith_number": "619",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن سلمه بن الأكوع رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: “لا يزال الرجل يذهب بنفسه حتى يكتب في الجبارين، فيصيبه ما أصابهم” ((رواه الترمذي وقال: حديث حسن. ((“يذهب بنفسه” أى: يرتفع ويتكبر)).",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Alah Resûlü şöyle buyurmuştur: Allah kıyamette şu üç kişi ile ne konuşur, ne onları temize çıkarır, ne de yüzlerine bakar. Onlar için şiddetli bir azap vardır: Zina eden ihtiyar, yalancı hükümdar ve kibirli fakir.",
      "text_en": "Salamah bin Al-Akwa' (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Man continues to display haughtiness and arrogance until he is recorded among the arrogant and will be therefore afflicted with what afflicts them.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/619:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/619:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/619:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
