      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000306",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 306",
      "hadith_number": "306",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \" يا نساء المسلمات لا تحقرن جارة لجارتها ولو فرسن شاة\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Allah’a ve âhiret gününe iman eden, komşusuna eziyet etmesin. Allah’a ve âhiret gününe iman eden, misafirine ikram etsin. Allah’a ve âhiret gününe iman eden, ya hayır söylesin ya da sussun.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"O Muslim women! No one of you should consider insignificant (a gift) to give to her neighbour even if it is (a gift of) the trotters of a sheep\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/306:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/306:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/306:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000740",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 740",
      "hadith_number": "740",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن جابر رضى الله عنه أن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم سأل أهله الأدم فقالوا: ما عندنا إلا خل، فدعا به، فجعل يأكل ويقول: \"نعم الأدم الخل، نعم الأدم الخل\" .",
      "text_tr": "Câbir’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Hz. Peygamber ailesinden (ekmeğine) katık (yapacağı bir şey) istemişti. Sirkeden başka bir şey yok, dediler. Resûlullah onun getirilmesini istedi ve “Sirke ne iyi katıktır, sirke ne güzel katıktır.” diyerek onu yemeye başladı.",
      "text_en": "Jabir (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) asked for sauce and was told that there was nothing except vinegar. He asked for it and began to eat from it saying, \"How excellent is vinegar when eaten as sauce! How excellent is vinegar when eaten as Udm!\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/740:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/740:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/740:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000391",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 391",
      "hadith_number": "391",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي عبد الله طارق بن أشيم ، رضي الله عنه ، قال: سمعت رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم يقول: \" من قال لا إله إلا الله ، وكفر بما يعبد من دون الله، حرم ماله ودمه، وحسابه على الله تعالى\"",
      "text_tr": "Muhtaçlara şefkatle kol kanat germek bahsinde geçen 258 numaralı Sa’d b. Ebû Vakkâs hadisi ile “Ebû Bekir, onları gücendirmiş olabilirsin. Eğer onları gücendirmiş isen Rabbini de gücendirmiş ve onun gazabını celbetmişsin demektir.” meâlindeki 259 numaralı hadistir.",
      "text_en": "Abu Abdullah bin Tariq bin Ashyam (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"He who professes La ilaha illallah (There is no true god except Allah), and denies of everything which the people worship besides Allah, his property and blood become inviolable, and it is for Allah to call him to account\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/391:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/391:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/391:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000425",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 425",
      "hadith_number": "425",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عبد الله بن عمرو بن العاص، رضي الله عنهما، أن النبي، صلى الله عليه وسلم، تلا قول الله عز وجل في إبراهيم، صلى الله عليه وسلم: {رب إنهن أضللن كثيراً من الناس فمن تبعني فإنه مني} ((إبراهيم:36))، وقول عيسى، صلى الله عليه وسلم:{إن تعذبهم فإنهم عبادك وإن تغفر لهم فإنك أنت العزيز الحكيم} ((المائدة: 118))، فرفع يديه وقال: \"اللهم أمتى أمتى” وبكى، فقال الله عز وجل:\" \" يا جبريل اذهب إلى محمد وربك أعلم، فسله ما يبكيه؟ “ فأتاه جبريل، فأخبره رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم، بما قال: وهو أعلم، فقال الله تعالى: \"يا جبريل اذهب إلى محمد فقل: إنا سنرضيك في أمتك ولا نسؤوك\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Bu canı bu tende tutan Allah’a yemin ederim ki, siz günah işlememiş olsaydınız, Allah sizi yok eder, yerinize günah işleyip, istiğfar edecek bir topluluk getirir, sonra da onları bağışlardı.",
      "text_en": "'Abdullah bin 'Amr bin Al-'as (May Allah be pleased with them) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) recited the Words of Allah, the Exalted, and the Glorious, about Ibrahim (ﷺ) who said: \"O my Rubb! They have led astray many among mankind. But whosoever follows me, he verily, is of me\". (14:36) and those of 'Isa (Jesus) (ﷺ) who said: \"If You punish them, they are Your slaves, and if You forgive them, verily, You, only You, are the All-Mighty, the All-Wise\". (5:118). Then he (ﷺ) raised up his hands and said, \"O Allah! My Ummah, my Ummah,\" and wept; Allah, the Exalted, said: \"O Jibril (Gabriel)! Go to Muhammad (ﷺ) and ask him: 'What makes you weep?\" So Jibril came to him and asked him (the reason of his weeping) and the Messenger of Allah informed him what he had said (though Allah knew it well). Upon this Allah said: \"Jibril, go to Muhammad (ﷺ) and say: 'Verily, We will please you with regard to your Ummah and will never displease you\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/425:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/425:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/425:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000061",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 61",
      "hadith_number": "61",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "الثانى: عن أبي ذر جندب بن جنادة، وأبي عبد الرحمن معاذ بن جبل، رضي الله عنهما، عن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم، قال: \" اتق الله حيثما كنت واتبع السيئة الحسنة تمحها، وخالق الناس بخلق حسن\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Zer Cündüb b. Cünâde ve Ebû Abdurrahmân Muâz b. Cebel’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Nerede olursan ol, Allah’tan kork; kötülük yaparsan, peşinden hemen iyilik yap ki, kötülüğü silip götürsün; insanlara karşı güzel ahlâkla davran.",
      "text_en": "Abu Dharr and Mu'adh bin Jabal (May Allah be pleased with them) reported that: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Fear Allah wherever you are, do good deeds after doing bad ones, the former will wipe out the latter, and behave decently towards people\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/61:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/61:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/61:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001879",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1879",
      "hadith_number": "1879",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن بن عمر رضي الله عنه قال: كنا نعد لرسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم في المجلس الواحد مائة مرة: \"رب اغفر لي، وتب على إنك أنت التواب الرحيم\" وقال :",
      "text_tr": "İbn Ömer (ra) anlatıyor: Biz Resûlullah’ın oturduğu bir mecliste tam yüz defa şöyle dediğini sayardık: “Rabbiğfirlî ve tüb aleyye inneke ente’t-tevvâbü’r-rahîm. (Yâ Rab, beni bağışla, tövbemi kabul et; çünkü sen tövbeleri çokça kabul edensin, çok merhamet edensin.)”",
      "text_en": "Ibn 'Umar (May Allah be pleased with them) said: We counted Messenger's saying a hundred times during one single sitting: Rabb- ighfir li, wa tubb 'alayya, innaka Antat-Tawwabur-Rahim. (My Rubb! Forgive me and pardon me. Indeed, You are the Oft-Returning with compassion and Ever Merciful.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1879:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1879:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1879:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000290",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 290",
      "hadith_number": "290",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي عبد الله - ويقال له: أبو عبد الرحمن - ثوبان بن بجدد مولى رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \" أفضل دينار ينفقه الرجل دينار ينفقه على عياله، ودينار ينفقه على دابته في سبيل الله، ودينار ينفقه على أصحابه في سبيل الله\"",
      "text_tr": "Kitabın başında, “Niyet” bölümünde Sa’d b. Ebû Vakkâs’tan (ra) naklettiğimiz uzun bir hadiste, Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Allah rızasını gözeterek eşinin ağzına koyduğun lokmaya varıncaya kadar, onlar için yaptığın her türlü harcama karşılığında sevap kazanırsın.",
      "text_en": "Thauban bin Bujdud (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"The most excellent dinar is one that a person spends on his family, and the dinar which he spends on his riding-animal in the way of Allah (in Jihad), and the dinar he spends on his companions in the way of Allah\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/290:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/290:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/290:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001079",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1079",
      "hadith_number": "1079",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن عمر رضي الله عنهما قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: \" بني الإسلام على خمس: شهادة أن لا إله إلا الله وأن محمدًا رسول الله، وإقام الصلاة، وإيتاء الزكاة، وحج البيت، وصوم رمضان\"",
      "text_tr": "İbn Ömer’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle demiştir: İslâm beş esas üzerine kurulmuştur: Allah’tan başka ilâh olmadığına ve Muhammed’in Allah’ın Resûlü olduğuna şahitlik etmek, namazı dosdoğru kılmak, zekât vermek, haccetmek ve Ramazan orucunu tutmak.",
      "text_en": "Ibn 'Umar (May Allah be pleased with them) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Islam is based on five (pillars): testifying that there is no true god except Allah and that Muhammad (ﷺ) is His slave and Messenger; performing of Salat (Iqamat-as-Salat); the payment of Zakat; performing Hajj (pilgrimage) to the House .",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1079:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1079:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1079:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000057",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 57",
      "hadith_number": "57",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "الرابع: عن أبي ثابت، وقيل أبي سعيد، وقيل أبي الوليد، سهل بن حنيف ، وهو بدري، رضي الله عنه، أن النبي ، صلى الله عليه وسلم، قال: \"من سأل الله، تعالى، الشهادة بصدق بلغه الله منازل الشهداء، وإن مات على فراشه\"",
      "text_tr": "Bedir Savaşı’nda bulunan, künyesi Ebû Sâbit, Ebû Saîd ya da Ebu’l-Velîd olan Sehl b. Huneyf’ten (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Peygamber şöyle demiştir: Bir kimse bütün samimiyetiyle Allah’tan şehitlik isterse Allah onu, yatağında ölse dahi şehitler mertebesine erdirir.",
      "text_en": "Abu Thabit from Sahl bin Hunaif (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Prophet (ﷺ) said: \"He who asks Allah for martyrdom, Allah will raise him to the high status of the martyrs, even if he dies on his bed\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/57:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/57:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/57:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
