      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000680",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 680",
      "hadith_number": "680",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبى هريرة رضي الله عنه أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: «إنكم ستحرصون على الإمارة، وستكون ندامة يوم القيامة»",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle demiştir: Siz yöneticiliği çok isteyeceksiniz. Oysa o, kıyamet gününde (ehil olmayanlar için) pişmanlık sebebi olacak.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported:\nMessenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"You will covet for getting a position of authority, but remember that it will be a cause of humiliation and remorse on the Day of Resurrection.\"",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/680:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/680:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/680:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001590",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1590",
      "hadith_number": "1590",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن مسعود، وابن عمر، وأنس رضي الله عنهم قالوا: قال النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم : \" لكل غادر لواء يوم القيامة، يقال: هذه غدرة فلان\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) nakledildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Bir kimsenin eşini veya uşağını ayartan bizden değildir.",
      "text_en": "Ibn Mas'ud, Ibn 'Umar and Anas (May Allah be pleased with them) said: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"For every one who breaks his covenant, there will be a (huge) flag on the Day of Resurrection and it will be said: 'This flag proclaims a breach of covenant by so-and-so.\"'.",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1590:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1590:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1590:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000338",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 338",
      "hadith_number": "338",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنه أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"من الكبائر شتم الرجل والديه!\" قالوا: يا رسول الله وهل يشتم الرجل والديه؟ ! قال: \"نعم؛ يسب أبا الرجل، فيسب أباه، ويسب أمه، فيسب أمه\" وفي رواية \"إن من أكبر الكبائر أن يلعن الرجل والديه!\" قيل : يا رسول الله كيف يلعن الرجل والديه؟ ! قال \"يسب أبا الرجل ، فيسب أباه، ويسب أمه، فيسب أمه\".",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Muhammed Cübeyr b. Mut’im’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Hısım ve akraba ile ilişkiyi kesenler cennete giremez. Süfyân (b. Uyeyne) bu hadisi rivayet ederken, “Peygamber, kâtı’un kelimesiyle, ‘akraba ile ilgiyi kesen kimseyi’ kastetmiştir.” dedi.",
      "text_en": "'Abdullah bin 'Amr bin Al-'as (May Allah be pleased with them) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"It is one of the gravest sins to abuse one's parents.\" It was asked (by the people): \"O Messenger of Allah, can a man abuse his own parents?\" Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"He abuses the father of somebody who, in return, abuses the former's father; he then abuses the mother of somebody who, in return, abuses his mother\".Another narration is: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"One of the major sins is to curse one's parents\". It was submitted: \"O Messenger of Allah! How can a man curse his own parents?\" He (ﷺ) said, \"When someone curses the parents of another man who in return abuses the former's father; and when someone abuses the mother of another man who in return abuses his mother.\"",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/338:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/338:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/338:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001352",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1352",
      "hadith_number": "1352",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن السائب بن يزيد، رضي الله عنه قال: لما قدم النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم من غزوة تبوك تلقاه الناس، فلقيته مع الصبيان على ثنية الوداع. و",
      "text_tr": "Sâib b. Yezîd (ra) anlatıyor: Tebük Gazvesi’nden dönüşünde halk Peygamber’i karşılamıştı. Onu, ben de çocuklarla beraber Seniyyetü’l-Vedâ denilen yerde karşıladım. (D2779 Ebû Dâvûd, Cihâd, 164) Buhârî’nin rivayetinde ravi: Biz Peygamber’i karşılamak için çocuklarla beraber Seniyyetü’l-Vedâ’ya gittik, demiştir.",
      "text_en": "As-Sa'ib bin Yazid (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: When the Prophet (ﷺ) returned from the battle of Tabuk, people went out from Al-Madinah to meet him and I also met him with other children at Thaniyah-tul-Wada'.",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1352:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1352:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1352:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000869",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 869",
      "hadith_number": "869",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أسماء بنت يزيد رضي الله عنه قالت: مر علينا النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم في نسوة فسلم علينا. ولفظ الترمذي: أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم مر في المسجد يومًا، وعصبة من النساء قعود، فألوى بيده بالتسليم.",
      "text_tr": "Esmâ bnt Yezîd’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre o, şöyle demiştir: Peygamber , biz hanımların yanından geçerken bize selâm verdi. Bu metin Ebû Dâvûd’undur. (D5204 Ebû Dâvûd, Edeb, 136, 137) Tirmizî’nin metni ise şöyledir: Resûlullah bir gün mescide uğradı. Birkaç kadın oturuyordu. Resûlullah onları eliyle selâmladı.",
      "text_en": "Asma bint Yazid (May Allah be pleased with her) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) passed by us when we were with a party of women, and he greeted us with salam. This is the wording of Abu Dawud. In At-Tirmidhi: that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) passed through the Masjid one day, and a group of women were sitting, so he motioned his hand with the salam.",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/869:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/869:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/869:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001690",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1690",
      "hadith_number": "1690",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن عمر رضي الله عنهما قال: وعد رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم جبريل أن يأتيه فراث عليه حتى اشتد على رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم، فخرج فلقيه جبريل فشكا إليه، فقال: إنا لا ندخل بيتًا فيه كلب ولا صورة. (( \"راث\": أبطأ، وهو بالثاء المثلثة)).",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’nin (ra) işittiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Allah Teâlâ, “Benim yaratışım gibi yaratmaya kalkışanlardan daha zalim kim olabilir! Onlar, (güçleri yetiyorsa) bir karınca, bir tahıl tanesi veya bir arpa tanesi yaratsınlar, (yoktan var etsinler bakalım).” buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "Ibn 'Umar (May Allah be pleased with them) said: Jibril (Gabriel) promised to visit the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) but delayed and this grieved him very much. When he came out of his house, Jibril met him. The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) asked him about the reason of delay, and he replied: \"We do not enter a house in which there is a dog or a portrait.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1690:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1690:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1690:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000530",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 530",
      "hadith_number": "530",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنه أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال وهو على المنبر، وذكر الصدقة والتعفف عن المسألة: \"اليد العليا خير من اليد السفلى. واليد العليا هي المنفقة، والسفلى هي السائلة\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Abdurrahmân Muâviye b. Ebû Süfyân Sahr b. Harb’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Israrla istemeyin. Vallahi biriniz benden bir şey ister de onun istemesi benim hoşuma gitmediği hâlde benden bir şey koparırsa, o verdiğim şeyin o kimseye bereketi olmaz.",
      "text_en": "Ibn 'Umar (May Allah be pleased with them) reported: While Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) was on his pulpit (in the mosque) delivering a Khutbah (religious talk) about Sadaqah (charity) and begging, he said, \"The upper hand is better than the lower hand, the upper hand is the one which gives and the lower hand is the begging one.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/530:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/530:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/530:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000275",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 275",
      "hadith_number": "275",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه قال : قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"لا يفرك مؤمن مؤمنة إن كره منها خُلقا رضي منها آخر\" أو قال : \"غيره\"",
      "text_tr": "Muâviye b. Hayde (ra) anlatıyor: –Yâ Resûlallah, hanımlarımızın bizim üzerimizdeki hakkı nedir, diye sordum. –Yediğinden ona da yedirmek, giyindiğin gibi onu da giydirmek. Ayrıca yüzüne vurma, onu kötüleme, bir de darılıp ayrı yatmaya mecbur kaldığında bunu sadece evinde yap, buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"A believer must not hate (his wife) believing woman; if he dislikes one of her characteristics he will be pleased with another\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/275:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/275:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/275:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001900",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1900",
      "hadith_number": "1900",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"إن أدنى مقعد أحدكم من الجنة أن يقول له: تمن فيتمنى ويتمنى، فيقول له: هل تمنيت؟ فيقول: نعم، فيقول له: فإن لك ما تمنيت ومثله معه\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) Resûlullah’ın şöyle buyurduğu rivayet edilmiştir: Biriniz cennetin en düşük derecesinde bile olsa kendisine “Dile dilediğini!” denilir. O da gönlünden dileklerde bulunur. Tamam mı, diye sorulur. Evet, deyince ona: “Neler dilediysen sana iki katı verilecek.” denir.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"The lowest place of any of you in Jannah will be that Allah will tell him to express his wish. He will wish and wish again. Allah will then ask him: 'Have you expressed your wish?' He will answer: 'Yes, I have.' Allah will say: 'You will have what you have wished for and the like thereof along with it.\"'.",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1900:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1900:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1900:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000938",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 938",
      "hadith_number": "938",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن مرثد بن عبد الله اليزني قال: كان مالك بن هبيرة رضي الله عنه إذا صلى علي الجنازة ، فتقال الناس عليها، جزأهم عليها ثلاثة أجزاء، ثم قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : “من صلى عليه ثلاثة صفوف، فقد أوجب “",
      "text_tr": "Mersed b. Abdullah el-Yezenî’den rivayet edildiğine göre o, şöyle demiştir: Mâlik b. Hübeyre (ra), cenaze namazı kılacağı zaman cemaati az görürse onları üç safa ayırır ve şöyle derdi: Resûlullah , “Bir kimseye üç saflık bir cemaat namaz kılarsa, o kimse cenneti hak etmiştir.” buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "Marthad bin 'Abdullah Al-Yazni reported: When Malik bin Hubairah (May Allah be pleased with him) offered a funeral prayer and found a small number of participants, he would divide them into three rows and would say that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"If three rows of men offer funeral prayer over anyone, his entry into Jannah will become certain.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/938:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/938:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/938:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000285",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 285",
      "hadith_number": "285",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \" لو كنت آمرًا أحدًا أن يسجد لأحد لأمرت المرأة أن تسجد لزوجها\"",
      "text_tr": "Muâz b. Cebel’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Hz. Peygamber şöyle buyurmuştur: Dünyada bir kadın kocasına eziyet ederse, onun hurilerden olan eşi şöyle der: “Allah canını alsın, bu adama eziyet etme. O, şimdilik senin yanında bir misafirdir; yakında senden ayrılıp bize kavuşacaktır.”",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"If I were to order anyone to prostrate himself before another, I would have ordered a woman to prostrate herself before her husband\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/285:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/285:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/285:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000052",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 52",
      "hadith_number": "52",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي يحيى أسيد بن حضير رضي الله عنه أن رجلاً من الأنصار قال: يا رسول الله ألا تستعملني كما استعملت فلاناً فقال: \"إنكم ستلقون بعدي أثرة، فاصبروا حتى تلقوني على الحوض\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Yahyâ Üseyd b. Hudayr (ra) anlatıyor: –Ey Allah’ın Resûlü, filan kimseyi vali tayin ettiğiniz gibi, beni de vali tayin etmez misin, dedi. Peygamber : –Siz benden sonra adam kayırma gibi durumlarla karşılaşacaksınız, bana (âhirette) havuz başında kavuşuncaya kadar sabredin, buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "Usaid bin Hudhair (May Allah be pleased with him) reported that: A person from among the Ansar said, \"O Messenger of Allah! You appointed such and such person and why do you not appoint me?\" Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"After me you will see others given preference to you, but you should remain patient till you meet me at the Haud (Al- Kauthar in Jannah)\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/52:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/52:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/52:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000292",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 292",
      "hadith_number": "292",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن سعد بن أبي وقاص رضي الله عنه في حديثه الطويل الذي قدمناه في أول الكتاب في باب النية أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال له: \" وإنك لن تنفق تبغي بها وجه الله إلا أجرت بها حتى ما تجعل في في امرأتك\"",
      "text_tr": "Abdullah b. Amr b. Âs’tan (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Bakmakla yükümlü olduğu kimseleri ihmal etmesi, bir insana günah olarak yeter. (D1692 Ebû Dâvûd, Zekât, 45) Müslim’in Sahih ’inde bu manada: Emri altında bulunanların nafakasını kısmak, bir insana günah olarak yeter, buyrulmuştur.",
      "text_en": "Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (May Allah be pleased with him) reported in a Hadith included in the chapter of Intention, that Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Whatever you spend seeking thereby the Pleasure of Allah, will have its reward, even the morsel which you put in the mouth of your wife\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/292:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/292:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/292:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000329",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 329",
      "hadith_number": "329",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه قال: لما نزلت هذه الآية: (وأنذر عشيرتك الأقربين) ((الشعراء: 214)) دعا رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قريشًا، فاجتمعوا فعم، وخص وقال: \"يا بني عبد شمس، يا بني كعب بن لؤي، أنقذوا أنفسكم من النار، يا بني مرة بن كعب، أنقذوا أنفسكم من النار، يا بني عبد مناف، أنقذوا أنفسكم من النار، يا بني هاشم أنقذوا أنفسكم من النار، يا بني عبد المطلب أنقذوا أنفسكم من النار، يا فاطمة أنقذي نفسك من النار، فإني لا أملك لكم من الله شيئًا، غير أن لكم رحما سأبلها ببلالها\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Eyyûb Hâlid b. Zeyd el-Ensârî (ra) anlatıyor: Bir adam: –Yâ Resûlallah, cennete girmeme sebep olacak ve beni cehennemden uzaklaştıracak bir amel söyle, dedi. Resûlullah : –Allah’a ibadet et ve O’na hiçbir şeyi ortak koşma, namaz kıl, zekât ver, akrabalık ilişkilerini gözet, buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: When this Verse was revealed: \"And warn your tribe (O Muhammad (ﷺ)) of near kindred\". (26:214) Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) called the Quraish; when they gathered, he said to them: \"O sons of 'Abd Shams; O sons of Ka'b bin Lu'ai, rescue yourselves from the Fire! O sons of Murrah bin Ka'b, rescue yourselves from the Fire! O sons of 'Abd Manaf, rescue yourselves from the Fire! O sons of 'Abdul-Muttalib, rescue yourselves from the Fire! O Fatimah, rescue yourself from the Fire, for I have no power (to protect you) from Allah in anything except that I would sustain relationship with you\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/329:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/329:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/329:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000299",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 299",
      "hadith_number": "299",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي حفص عمر بن أبي سلمة عبد الله بن عبد الأسد ربيب رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: كنت غلامًا في حجر رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم وكانت يدي تطيش في الصحفة، فقال لي رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \" يا غلام سَمِّ الله تعالى، وكُل بيمينك، وكُل مما يليك\" فما زالت تلك طعمتي بعد.",
      "text_tr": "Amr b. Şuayb’ın babası aracılığıyla dedesi Abdullah b. Amr’dan (ra) rivayet ettiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Çocuklarınızdan yedi yaşına geldiklerinde namaz kılmalarını isteyin. On yaşına bastıklarında ise namaz kılmaları için paylayın; (kardeş de olsalar) yataklarını ayırın.”",
      "text_en": "'Umar bin Abu Salamah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: I was a boy under the care of Messenger of Allah (ﷺ), and my hand would wander about in the dish. Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said to me \"Mention Allah's Name (i.e., say Bismillah before you start eating), eat with your right hand and eat from what is near to you\". I always followed this way of eating after this incident.",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/299:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/299:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/299:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000098",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 98",
      "hadith_number": "98",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "الرابع: عن عائشة رضي الله عنها أن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم كان يقوم من الليل حتى تنفطر قدماه، فقلت له: لم تصنع هذا يا رسول الله، وقد غفر الله لك ما تقدم من ذنبك وما تأخر؟! قال: \" أفلا أحب أن أكون عبداً شكوراً؟\"",
      "text_tr": "Hz. Âişe (ra) anlatıyor: Peygamber , gece kalkar ve ayakları şişinceye kadar namaz kılardı. (Bir seferinde) –Yâ Resûlallah, niçin böyle yapıyorsun? Allah senin geçmiş ve gelecek bütün günahlarını bağışlamıştır, dedim. Peygamber şöyle buyurdu: –Ben, şükreden bir kul olmayı isteyemez miyim? (B4837 Buhârî, Tefsîr, (Fetih) 2; M7126 Müslim, Münâfikîn, 81)",
      "text_en": "'Aishah (May Allah be pleased with her) said: The Prophet (ﷺ) would stand (in prayer) so long that the skin of his feet would crack. I asked him, \"Why do you do this while your past and future sins have been forgiven?\" He said, \"Should I not be a grateful slave of Allah?\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/98:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/98:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/98:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001252",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1252",
      "hadith_number": "1252",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن مجيبة الباهلية عن أبيها أو عمها، أنه أتى رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم ثم انطلق فأتاه بعد سنة وقد تغيرت حاله وهيئته، فقال: يا رسول الله أما تعرفني؟ قال: \"ومن أنت؟\" قال: أنا الباهلي الذي جئتك عام الأول. قال: \"فما غيرك، وقد كنت حسن الهيئة؟\" قال: ما أكلت طعامًا منذ فارقتك إلا بليل. فقال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم \"عذبت نفسك!\" ثم قال: \"صم شهر الصبر، ويومًا من كل شهر\" قال: زدني، فإن بي قوة، قال: \" صم يومين\" قال: زذني، قال: \"صم ثلاثة أيام\" قال: زدني. قال: \"صم من الحرم واترك، صم من الحرم واترك، صم من الحرم واترك\" وقال بأصابعه الثلاث فضمها، ثم أرسلها.",
      "text_tr": "Hz. Âişe’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre o, şöyle demiştir: Peygamber , hiçbir ayda Şa’ban’da tuttuğu oruçtan fazla oruç tutmazdı. Şa’ban ayının (neredeyse) tamamını oruçlu geçirirdi. (B1970 Buhârî, Savm, 52; M2722, M2723 Müslim, Sıyâm, 176, 177) Diğer bir rivayet de “Pek az bir kısmı müstesna olmak üzere Şa’ban ayını oruçlu geçirirdi.” şeklindedir.",
      "text_en": "Reported Mujibah Al-Bahiliyah on the authority of her father or uncle that he visited the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) once and then went to see him again after a year. His appearance had totally changed. He asked the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) if he had recognized him. The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) asked, \"Who are you?\" He replied: \"I am Al- Bahili who visited you last year.\" The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"You were quite handsome, what has changed your appearance so much?\" He replied, \"Since my departure from here, I have not eaten anything except at night.\" The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) remarked, \"You have put yourself to torture. Observe Saum (fasting) during the Month of Patience (i.e., Ramadan) and fast one day from each month.\" He submitted, \"Permit me to observe more voluntary fasts because I have capacity to do so.\" The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Then observe fasts for two days in every month.\" He said, \"Permit me to observe more.\" The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Observe fasts on three days in every month.\" He requested that he should be allowed to observe more fasts. The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Fast three days during the sacred months and omit fasting for three days alternately.\" He (ﷺ) joined his three fingers together and left them apart while repeating this sentence thrice.",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1252:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1252:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1252:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000310",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 310",
      "hadith_number": "310",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عائشة رضي الله عنها قالت: قلت: يارسول الله إن لي جارين، فإلى أيهما أُهْدِي؟ قال: \" إلى أقربهما منك بابًا\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Abdurrahmân Abdullah b. Mes’ûd (ra) anlatıyor: Peygamber’e : –Allah’ın en sevdiği amel nedir, diye sordum. Peygamber : –Vaktinde kılınan namazdır, buyurdu. –Sonra hangisidir, dedim. –Anne babaya iyilik etmektir, buyurdu. –Sonra hangisidir, dedim. –Allah yolunda cihad etmektir, buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "'Aishah (May Allah be pleased with her) reported: I said, \"O Messenger of Allah (ﷺ), I have two neighbours, to which of them should I send a present?\" He (ﷺ) replied, \"To the one whose door is nearer to you\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/310:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/310:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/310:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000096",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 96",
      "hadith_number": "96",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "الثاني: عن أنس رضي الله عنه عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم فيما يرويه عن ربه عز وجل قال: \" إذا تقرب العبد إلي شبراً تقربت إليه ذراعاً، وإذا تقرب إلي ذراعاً تقربت منه باعاً، وإذا أتاني يمشي أتيته هرولة\"",
      "text_tr": "Enes’ten (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Peygamber , Azîz ve Celîl olan Rabbinden naklettiği bir hadiste şöyle demiştir: “Kulum, bana bir karış yaklaşırsa, ben ona bir arşın yaklaşırım; bana bir arşın yaklaşırsa, ben ona bir kulaç yaklaşırım. O bana yürüyerek gelirse, ben ona koşarak gelirim.”",
      "text_en": "Anas (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"Allah says: ' When a slave of Mine draws near to Me a span, I draw near to him a cubit; and if he draws near to Me a cubit, I draw near to him a fathom. And if he comes to Me walking, I go to him running.\"'.",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/96:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/96:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/96:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000367",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 367",
      "hadith_number": "367",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه أن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \" الرجل على دين خليله، فلينظر أحدكم من يخالل\".",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Mûsâ el-Eş’arî’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Hz. Peygamber şöyle buyurmuştur: Kişi sevdiği ile beraberdir. (B6168 Buhârî, Edeb, 96; M6718 Müslim, Birr, 165) Bir rivayette, Resûlullah’a : –Yâ Resûlallah, bir adam bir topluluğu sever, fakat onlara kavuşamazsa ne buyurursun, diye sorulduğunda: –Kişi sevdiği ile beraberdir, buyurmuştur.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: I heard the Prophet (ﷺ) saying, \"Man follows his friend's religion, you should be careful who you take for friends\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/367:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/367:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/367:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
