    {
      "id": "hadith_001072",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1072",
      "hadith_number": "1072",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"والذي نفسي بيده، لقد هممت أن آمر بحطب فيحتطب، ثم آمر بالصلاة فيؤذن لها، ثم آمر رجلا فيؤم الناس، ثم أخالف إلى رجال فأحرق عليهم بيوتهم\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle demiştir: Bu canı bu tende tutan Allah’a yemin ederim ki, bir an içimden şöyle geçirdim: Emredeyim, odunlar yığılsın. Yine emredeyim namaz için ezan okunsun. Sonra emredeyim biri müminlere imamlık yapsın. Daha sonra da gidip namaza gelmeyenlerin evlerini yakayım.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"By Him in Whose Hand my life is, I sometimes thought of giving orders for firewood to be collected, then for proclaiming the Adhan for Salat. Then I would appoint an Imam to lead Salat, and then go to the houses of those who do not come to perform Salat in congregation, and set fire to their houses on them.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1072:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1072:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1072:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
