        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001610",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1610",
      "hadith_number": "1610",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن عمر رضي الله عنهما أن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"من ضرب غلامًا له حدًا لم يأتهِ، أو لطمه، فإن كفارته أن يعتقه\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Alî Süveyd b. Mukarrin (ra) şöyle anlatıyor: Ben Mukarrinoğulları’ndan yedi kardeşin yedincisi idim. Bizim tek bir uşağımız vardı. En küçüğümüz onu tokatlamıştı. Bunun üzerine Resûlullah , onu azat etmemizi emretti.",
      "text_en": "Ibn 'Umar (May Allah be pleased with them) reported: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"The expiation for beating or slapping a slave on the face for something he has not done is to set him free.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1610:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1610:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1610:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
