        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000362",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 362",
      "hadith_number": "362",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: \"من عاد مريضًا أو زار أخًا له في الله، ناداه منادٍ، بأن طبت، وطاب ممشاك، وتبوأت من الجنة منزلاً\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Mûsâ el-Eş’arî’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Hz. Peygamber şöyle buyurmuştur: İyi arkadaşla kötü arkadaşın misali, güzel koku satanla demircinin misali gibidir. Güzel koku satan adam, ya sana güzel kokusundan bir miktar verir veya sen satın alırsın, yahut ondan hoş koku koklarsın. Körük üfüren demirciye gelince, ondan sana ya bir kıvılcım isabet eder elbiseni yakarsın yahut körüğün kötü kokusundan rahatsız olursun.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: I heard Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying, \"Whosoever visits an ailing person or a brother of his to seek the Pleasure of Allah, an announcer (angel) calls out: 'May you be happy, may your walking be blessed, and may you be awarded a dignified position in Jannah\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/362:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/362:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/362:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001340",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1340",
      "hadith_number": "1340",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنه، رضي الله عنه قال: سمعت رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم يقول: \"إن الله يدخل بالسهم الواحد ثلاثة نفر الجنة: صانعه يحتسب في صنعته الخير، والرامي به ومنبله. وارموا واركبوا، وأن ترموا أحب إلي من أن تركبوا. ومن ترك الرمي بعد ما علمه رغبة عنه فإنها نعمة تركها\" أو قال: \"كفرها\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hammâd’ın (ra) işittiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle demiştir: Allah, bir tek ok yüzünden üç kimseyi cennete koyar: Allah rızası için o oku yapanı, onu Allah yolunda atanı, oku atıcıya vereni. Atıcılık ve binicilik öğrenin. Atıcılık öğrenmeniz, binicilik öğrenmenizden daha fazla hoşuma gider. Öğrendikten sonra yüz çevirerek atıcılığı bırakan kimse için o, terk ettiği veya nankörlük yaptığı bir nimettir (ve bundan sorulacaktır).",
      "text_en": "'Uqbah bin 'Amir Al-Juhani (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying, \"Allah will admit three persons to Jannah for one arrow; the maker who has a good motive in making it, the one who shoots it, and the one who hands it up for shooting. So shoot and ride, but I like your shooting (more) than your riding. He who gives up archery after becoming adept in it for lack of interest, neglects a (great) blessing.\" (Or said,) \"One who does so is ungrateful.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1340:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1340:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1340:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001839",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1839",
      "hadith_number": "1839",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه أن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"لا يلدغ المؤمن من جحر مرتين\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Sa’lebe el-Huşenî Cürsûm b. Nâşir’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Allah Teâlâ birtakım şeyleri farz kılmıştır, onları yitirmeyin. Bazı sınırlar (günahlar için cezalar) koymuştur; onları aşmayın. Birtakım şeyleri haram etmiştir; onlara da el uzatmayın. Unutmuş olduğu için değil, sırf size merhametinden dolayı bir kısım şeylerin hükümleri hakkında da bir şey dememiştir; onları da soruşturmayın. (DK4306 Dârekutni, es-Sünen, IV, 183; NM7114 Hâkim, el-Müstedrek, VII, 2542 (4/115))",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"A believer should not be stung twice from the same hole.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1839:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1839:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1839:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001077",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1077",
      "hadith_number": "1077",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"ليس صلاة أثقل على المنافقين من صلاة الفجر والعشاء ولو يعلمون ما فيهما لأتوهما ولو حبوًا\"",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah : Münafıklara sabah ile yatsı namazlarından daha ağır gelen hiçbir namaz yoktur. Eğer insanlar bu iki namazdaki sevabı bilselerdi, emekleyerek de olsa kılmaya gelirlerdi, demiştir.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"No Salat is more burdensome to the hypocrites than the Fajr (dawn) prayer and the 'Isha' (night) prayer; and if they knew their merits, they would come to them even if they had to crawl to do so.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1077:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1077:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1077:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000665",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 665",
      "hadith_number": "665",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أنس رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم “اسمعوا وأطيعوا، وإن استعمل عليكم عبد حبشي، كأن رأسه زبيبة”",
      "text_tr": "İyâz b. Himâr’ın (ra) işittiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Cennet ehli üç sınıftır: adaleti gözeten başarılı yöneticiler; bütün akrabalarına ve Müslümanlara karşı yumuşak kalpli ve şefkatli olanlar; (muhtaç durumda) çoluk çocuğu olduğu hâlde harama el uzatmayan ve kimseden de bir şey istemeyen kişiler.",
      "text_en": "Anas (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Hear and obey even if an Abyssinian slave whose head is like a raisin is placed in authority over you.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/665:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/665:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/665:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001048",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1048",
      "hadith_number": "1048",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن مسعود رضي الله عنه أن رجلا أصاب من امرأة قُبلةً، فأتى النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم فأخبره فأنزل الله تعالى: {أقم الصلاة طرفي النهار وزلفًا من الليل، إن الحسنات يذهبن السيئات} فقال الرجل: ألي هذا؟ قال: \"لجميع أمتي كلهم\"",
      "text_tr": "İbn Mes’ûd’dan (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre o, şöyle demiştir: Bir adam bir kadını öptü (ve pişman olarak) Peygamber’e gelip durumu haber verdi. Derken Allah Teâlâ “Gündüzün iki ucunda ve gecenin ilk saatlerinde namaz kıl; çünkü iyilikler kötülükleri giderir.” mealindeki âyet-i kerimeyi indirdi. Bunun üzerine adam “Bu hüküm yalnız benim için mi geçerli?” diye sordu. Resûlullah “Ümmetimin tamamı için geçerlidir.” cevabını verdi.",
      "text_en": "Ibn Mas'ud (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: A man kissed a woman. So he came to the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) and informed him about it. Then Allah revealed this Ayah: \"And perform the Salat, between the two ends of the day and in some hours of the night. Verily, the good deeds efface the evil deeds (i.e., minor sins).\" (11:114) The man asked the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) whether this applies to him only. The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"It applies to all of my Ummah.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1048:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1048:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1048:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001484",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1484",
      "hadith_number": "1484",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن زيد بن أرقم رضي الله عنه قال: كان رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم، يقول: \"اللهم إني أعوذ بك من العجز والكسل، والبخل والهرم، وعذاب القبر، اللهم آت نفسي تقواها، وزكها أنت خير من زكاها، أنت وليها ومولاها، اللهم إني أعوذ بك من علم لا ينفع ومن قلب لا يخشع، ومن نفس لا تشبع، ومن دعوة لا يستجاب لها\".",
      "text_tr": "Zeyd b. Erkâm’dan (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle dua ederdi: Allah’ım, acizlikten, tembellikten, cimrilikten, bunaklık derecesinde ihtiyarlıktan, kabir azabından sana sığınırım. Allah’ım, bana sorumluluk bilinci ver ve beni (günahlardan) arındır. En iyi arındıracak sensin. Benim sahibim ve Mevlam sensin. Allah’ım, faydalanılmayan ilimden; korkmayan kalpten, doymayan nefisten; kabul olunmayan duadan sana sığınırım.",
      "text_en": "Zaid bin Arqam (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) would supplicate: \"Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-'ajzi wal-kasali, wal-bukhli wal-harami, wa 'adhabil-qabri. Allahumma ati nafsi taqwaha, wa zakkiha Anta khairu man zakkaha, Anta waliyyuha wa maulaha. Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min 'ilmin la yanfau', wa min qalbin la yakhsha'u, wa min nafsin la tashba'u, wa min da'watin la yustajabu laha' .",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1484:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1484:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1484:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000928",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 928",
      "hadith_number": "928",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أسامة بن زيد رضي الله عنهما قال: أرسلت إحدي بنات النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم الله عليه وسلمى الله عليه وسلم الله عليه وسلم إليه تدعوه وتخبره أن صبياً لها -أو ابناً- في الموت فقال للرسول: ارجع إليها فأخبرها أن لله تعالي ما أخذ وله ما أعطى، وكل شئ عنده بأجل مسمى، فمرها، فلتصبر ولتحتسب” وذكر تمام الحديث\"",
      "text_tr": "Üsâme b. Zeyd(ra) anlatıyor: Peygamber’in kızlarından biri, çocuğunun (veya oğlunun) ölmek üzere olduğunu bildirmesi için Resûlullah’a bir haberci göndererek onu evine çağırdı. (Muhtemelen çok önemli bir konu için toplantı hâlinde olan) Resûlullah gelen haberciye şöyle dedi: Onun yanına dön ve kendisine, alanın da verenin de Allah olduğunu, O’nun katında her şeyin vaktinin belirli olduğunu söyle. Sabretsin ve Allah’tan ecir beklesin.",
      "text_en": "Usamah bin Zaid (May Allah be pleased with them) reported: A daughter of the Prophet (ﷺ) sent a message to him that her son was at his last breath, and requested him to come to her. The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) sent back the informer saying: \"To Allah belongs what He takes and what He gives, and everything has a limited period (in this world). So ask her to endure patiently, and expect the reward of Allah.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/928:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/928:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/928:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001426",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1426",
      "hadith_number": "1426",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن سعد بن أبي وقاص رضي الله عنه أن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم كان يتعوذ دبر الصلوات بهؤلاء الكلمات: \"اللهم إني أعوذ بك من الجبن والبخل، وأعوذ بك من أن أرد إلى أرذل العمر وأعوذ بك من فتنة الدنيا، وأعوذ بك من فتنة القبر”",
      "text_tr": "Sa’d b. Ebû Vakkâs’tan (ra) şöyle nakledilmiştir: Resûlullah , namazların sonunda Allah’a şöyle dua ederek sığınırdı: “Allâhümme innî eûzü bike mine’l–cübni ve’l–buhli ve eûzü bike min en üredde ilâ erzeli’l–umri ve eûzü bike min fitneti’d–dünyâ, ve eûzü bike min fitneti’l–kabr. (Allah’ım! Korkaklıktan ve cimrilikten sana sığınırım. Düşkün ihtiyarlıktan sana sığınırım. Dünya fitnelerinden sana sığınırım. Kabir azabından sana sığınırım.)”",
      "text_en": "Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) used to seek (Allah's) protection after prayers in these words: \"Alla-humma inni a'udhu bika minal-jubni wal- bukhl, wa a'udhu bika min an uradda ila ardhalil-'umur, wa a'udhu bika min fitnatid-dunya, wa a'udhu bika min fitnatil-qabr (O Allah, I seek refuge with You from cowardice, miserliness and from being sent back to a feeble age; and, seek refuge with You from the trials of this life and those of the grave).\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1426:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1426:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1426:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
