    {
      "id": "hadith_001888",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1888",
      "hadith_number": "1888",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"قال الله تعالى أعددت لعبادي الصالحين ما لا عين رأت ولا أذن سمعت ولا خطر على قلب بشر، واقرؤوا إن شئتم: {فلا تعلم نفس ما أخفي لهم من قرة أعين جزاء بما كانوا يعملون} ((السجدة:17))",
      "text_tr": "Ebû Hüreyre’den (ra), Resûlullah’ın şöyle buyurduğu rivayet edilmiştir: Allah Teâlâ, “Salih kullarım için cennette hiçbir gözün görmediği, hiçbir kulağın işitmediği ve hiçbir insanın gönlünden dahi geçirmediği nice nimetler hazırladım.” buyurdu. Bundan sonra Ebû Hüreyre, isterseniz şu âyeti okuyun, demiştir: “Müminlerin işledikleri hayır ve ibadetlerin mükâfatı olarak (Allah hazinesinde) saklanmış olan o göz aydınlığı nimetleri kimse bilmez.”",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Allah, the Exalted, has said: 'I have prepared for my righteous slaves what no eye has seen, no ear has heard, and the mind of no man has conceived.' If you wish, recite:'No person knows what is kept hidden for them of joy as a reward for what they used to do.\"' (32:17).",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1888:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1888:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1888:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000278",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 278",
      "hadith_number": "278",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أبي هريرة رضي الله عنه قال : قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم \"أكمل المؤمنين إيمانا أحسنهم خُلقا، وخياركم خياركم لنسائهم\"",
      "text_tr": "Amr b. Âs’ın oğlu Abdullah’tan (ra) rivayet edildiğine göre Resûlullah şöyle buyurmuştur: Dünya nimetlerle doludur. Onun en gözde nimeti de saliha kadındır.",
      "text_en": "Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"The believers who show the most perfect Faith are those who have the best behaviour, and the best of you are those who are the best to their wives\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/278:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/278:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/278:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_001663",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1663",
      "hadith_number": "1663",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن ابن مسعود رضي الله عنه قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \"ليس منا من ضرب الخدود، وشق الجيوب، ودعا بدعوى الجاهليه\"",
      "text_tr": "Mesrûk’un şöyle dediği rivayet edilmiştir: Bir gün Abdullah b. Mes’ûd’un yanına vardık. O: –Ey insanlar, birşeyler bilen onu söylesin. Bilmeyen de “Allah bilir.”, desin. Zira kişinin bilmediği bir şey hakkında ‘Allah bilir.’ demesi de ilim (edebin)dendir. Yüce Allah, Peygamber’ine şöyle buyurmuştur: (Ey Muhammed!) De ki: “Bundan (tebliğ görevinden) dolayı sizden hiçbir ücret istemiyorum. Ben kendiliğinden yükümlülük altına girenlerden değilim.” (B4809 Buhârî, Tefsîr (Sâd), 2) Sâd, 38/86. riyaz3-69 Cenazenin Ardından Yas Tutmak",
      "text_en": "Ibn Mas'ud (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"He who (on befalling a calamity) slaps his cheeks, tears his clothes and follows the ways and traditions of the Days of Ignorance is none of us.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1663:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1663:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1663:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
