      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hadith_000269",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 269",
      "hadith_number": "269",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن عائشة رضي الله عنها قالت: جاءتني مسكينة تحمل ابنتين لها، فأطعمتها ثلاث تمرات، فأعطت كل واحدة منهما تمرة ورفعت إلى فيها تمرة لتأكلها ، فاستطعمتها ابنتاها، فشقت التمرة التي كانت تريد أن تأكلها بينهما، فأعجبني شأنها، فذكرت الذي صنعت لرسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم فقال: \"إن الله قد أوجب لها بها الجنة، أو أعتقها بها من النار\"",
      "text_tr": "Sa’d b. Ebû Vakkâs’ın oğlu Mus’ab (ra), anlatıyor: Bazı meziyetleri dolayısıyla Sa’d, daha aşağı seviyedekilere göre kendisinin üstün olduğunu sanırdı. Bunun üzerine Peygamber : Allah size ancak zayıflarınızın (duası, ibadeti ve ihlâsları) sayesinde yardım ediyor ve rızık veriyor, buyurdu.",
      "text_en": "'Aishah (May Allah be pleased with her) reported: A poor woman came to me carrying her two daughters. I gave her three date-fruits. She gave a date to each of them and then she took up one date-fruit and brought that to her mouth to eat, but her daughters asked her that also. She then divided between them the date-fruit that she intended to eat. This (kind) treatment of her impressed me and I mentioned that to Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) who said, 'Verily, Allah has assured Jannah for her, because of (this act) of her,\" or said, \"He (SWT) has rescued her from Hell- Fire\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/269:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/269:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/269:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
