    {
      "id": "hadith_001797",
      "type": "hadith",
      "collection": "Riyazu's-Salihin",
      "book": "Riyad as-Salihin 1797",
      "hadith_number": "1797",
      "narrator": "requires verification",
      "text_ar": "وعن أسامة بن زيد رضي الله عنه عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال: \"إذا سمعتم الطاعون بأرض، فلا تدخلوها، وإذا وقع بأرض، وأنتم فيها، فلا تخرجوا منها\"",
      "text_tr": "Hemmâm b. Hâris’in, Mikdâd’dan (ra) rivayet ettiğine göre bir gün bir adam Hz. Osman’ı övmeye başlayınca, orada bulunan Mikdâd, diz çökerek öven kişinin yüzüne ufacık taşları atmaya başladı. Bunun üzerine Hz. Osman: –Ne yapıyorsun, deyince o da: –Resûlullah , “İnsanları övüp duranları gördüğünüz zaman yüzlerine toprak saçın.” buyurdu, dedi.",
      "text_en": "Usamah bin Zaid (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Prophet (ﷺ) said, \"If you get wind of the outbreak of plague in a land, do not enter it; and if it breaks out in a land in which you are, do not leave it.\".",
      "source_ar": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1797:ar",
      "source_tr": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1797:tr",
      "source_en": "local_approved:riyazussalihin/1797:en",
      "grade": "riyad_as_salihin_selection",
      "source_note": "local approved payload; approved_at=2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
      "topics": [
        "hadis_approved_pool"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "durum": "yayina_hazir",
      "priority": 1,
      "book_reference_tr": "",
      "book_reference_en": "",
      "approval": {
        "approved_by": "local_review_tool",
        "approved_at": "2026-06-09T08:35:54+00:00",
        "review_note": "Synced from local approved payload."
      }
